4-08-01 15:41:23'),(994966,'Episode 1',NULL,'',1,61714,NULL,61005,NULL,'0',0,'2010-02-15',1,'2024-07-28 09:57:38','2024-11-08 13:45:19'),(1256182,'BoBoiBoy Kembali!','Cici Ko and MotoBot have been trapped in space from the Power Sphere Hunter and the pirate minions started to head to Cici Ko\'s spaceship. BoBoiBoy and Gopal took the opportunity to become a hero by defeating that Power Sphere Hunter.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/naqEa49rlVLkY3r1caN0dhmOdYA.jpg',69620,NULL,'6.5',2,'2016-11-25',1,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1256186,'Power Sphera, Motobot!','Adu Du and Probe arrived on Earth and has captured MotoBot. Then Cici Ko, Ochobot, BoBoiBoy and Gopal track MotoBot\'s location to save him and at the same time they also fought with their old enemies.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6AgVpsogPXdZixugLIoj3bKLH2I.jpg',69620,NULL,'9.2',4,'2016-12-02',2,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1256187,'Kembara Planet Gurunda','BoBoiBoy and Gopal having been initiated into TAPOPS, are sent on a mission to a planet called Gurunda.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mVDMtdmR94mMQoCxcDpCTbh58FZ.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2016-12-09',3,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1256188,'Gergasi Comel Cattus','BoBoiBoy and his friends continue searching for the Power Sphere.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ltJZBNLmjwYwP7fScbocQGnwW6U.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2016-12-16',4,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1256189,'BoBoiBoy Daun vs Lanun','Having returned back to Earth from their mission on the planet Gurunda, BoBoiBoy and friends are suddenly attacked by Captain Separo and his band of Space Pirates, who attempt to steal all the Power Spheres.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bKmDr8Wj3JbB0DukTQYfKukbX6Q.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2016-12-23',5,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1256190,'Fang Pelengkap Pasukan','BoBoiBoy with his friends departs on the Cici Ko\'s spaceship to travel to TAPOPS Space Station, but a stowaway causes some problems. The travel might not be so safe after all.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/46GJpmChFRWwsHXlBBhGH1ifzOI.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2016-12-30',6,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1257267,'MISI: I.R.I.S','Ali is a normal 12-year-old schoolboy who struggles in school, is a victim of bullying, and lacks of parental love. His life changes forever when he accidentally wields a spy tech stolen by two evil spies.','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cPybPxuoJFVbiqJgHimf3DWCUcJ.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2016-04-08',1,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257268,'MISI: ALPHA','When Dr. Tong suddenly announces his retirement, this raises suspicion on M.A.T.A. and Ali is sent into his first mission - using the I.R.I.S.!','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9uZzJKm4R0YJkfy8kubhd6uLeS3.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2016-04-15',2,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257269,'MISI: Seri','While trying to stop Komeng and his men from stealing the drones, Ali meets a mysterious ally who helps him to defeat them. But things get a turn when Ali finds out the identity of the mysterious ally.','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qlU7CqY9Yt6Qpij2wn5nwO6e0WW.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2016-04-22',3,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257270,'MISI: Comot','After saving a stray cat from being run over by a car, Ali realizes that the cat reminds him of his old pet cat Labu, who ran away from house after his moter\'s death. Hence, he adopts it. What he does not know is that the cat has ulterior motives - to steal the I.R.I.S.','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2xSfSWlEfNalDMlLz81JG2xaYHC.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2016-07-22',4,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257271,'MISI: Blueprint','When Dos and Trez manage to steal two pieces of pen drive that contain the blueprint of I.R.I.S., the M.A.T.A. agents are on a mission to retrieve them before they can decrypt it.','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h9uM1zq8OhjTIKwJwN7xEbls3hi.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2016-07-29',5,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257272,'MISI: Bangkit','After Dr. Tong and Dr. Mala are being victimized by Dr. Aaron, Ali, Bakar, Alicia and Comot must protect Dr. Ghazali from him before it is too late.','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sHP9Gd6FrVkV5QamlPDfSgDMR18.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2016-08-05',6,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257273,'MISI: Protokol Gegas','When a mission goes wrong, Alicia states that she would have summoned \"Protocol Gegas\" if it wasn\'t for the I.R.I.S. that Ali wears because M.A.T.A. promises to keep him alive. When there is a power disruption occurring in Cyberaya, the M.A.T.A. agents are sent to investigate the power plants. During the mission, Ali is horrified to learn about the purpose of \"Protocol Gegas\" from Bakar. When the protocol is really being used, will he follow it?','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jfdKQjc6Ke5o0Uc5PwhCfdH4CsG.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2016-10-28',7,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257274,'MISI: Prestasi','After the previous mission goes wrong, General Rama discusses with Ali and the other M.A.T.A. agents about Ali\'s performance, and must decide whether to keep or eliminate Ali.','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1ahQJ7iQd9Z0jycFJ72sGBWfJjw.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2016-11-04',8,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257275,'MISI: Potensi','Since the previous episode, Rizwan is now Ali\'s mentor and he must train him to be a better agent despite he has doubts on Ali.','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/RdiMEoUbMSBAhp1sPLpMM3V8YC.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2016-11-11',9,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257276,'MISI: Sensasi','After the video of Ali saving Aunty Faye\'s life goes viral on Internet, Ali creates a new page for his agent self and has become obsessed of the popularity he gains. However, his new-found fame will bring grave danger to him...','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vESrzbneCwnU7vYLGemkVpNjuyz.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2016-12-22',10,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257277,'MISI: Bukti','Unable to believe that Bakar is the traitor of M.A.T.A., Ali is determined to prove that he is innocent.','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3TIYxVxjufx9ZqVIyo2ZuX6wYTq.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2017-01-06',11,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1257278,'MISI: Uno','Uno has hacked into M.A.T.A. headquarters and his only mission is to capture Ali.','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/anmjnYyNV5GiGDFpzmeHAEAw8TW.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2017-01-13',12,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1258127,'Episode 1',NULL,'',3,84080,NULL,69753,NULL,'0',0,'2016-10-16',1,'2024-11-29 15:22:29','2024-11-29 23:23:19'),(1258128,'Episode 2',NULL,'',3,84080,NULL,69753,NULL,'0',0,'2016-10-23',2,'2024-11-29 15:22:29','2024-11-29 23:23:19'),(1258129,'Episode 3',NULL,'',3,84080,NULL,69753,NULL,'0',0,'2016-10-30',3,'2024-11-29 15:22:29','2024-11-29 23:23:19'),(1258130,'Episode 4',NULL,'',3,84080,NULL,69753,NULL,'0',0,'2016-11-06',4,'2024-11-29 15:22:29','2024-11-29 23:23:19'),(1258131,'Episode 5',NULL,'',3,84080,NULL,69753,NULL,'0',0,'2016-11-13',5,'2024-11-29 15:22:29','2024-11-29 23:23:19'),(1258132,'Episode 6',NULL,'',3,84080,NULL,69753,NULL,'0',0,'2016-11-20',6,'2024-11-29 15:22:29','2024-11-29 23:23:19'),(1258133,'Episode 7',NULL,'',3,84080,NULL,69753,NULL,'0',0,'2016-11-27',7,'2024-11-29 15:22:29','2024-11-29 23:23:19'),(1258134,'Episode 8',NULL,'',3,84080,NULL,69753,NULL,'0',0,'2016-12-04',8,'2024-11-29 15:22:29','2024-11-29 23:23:19'),(1267196,'Episode 1',NULL,'',1,84900,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2016-12-16',1,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1267197,'Episode 2',NULL,'',1,84900,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2016-12-23',2,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1267198,'Episode 3',NULL,'',1,84900,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2016-12-30',3,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1267199,'Episode 4',NULL,'',1,84900,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-01-06',4,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1267200,'Episode 5',NULL,'',1,84900,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-01-13',5,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1267201,'Episode 6',NULL,'',1,84900,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-01-20',6,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1267202,'Episode 7',NULL,'',1,84900,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-01-27',7,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1267203,'Episode 8',NULL,'',1,84900,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-02-03',8,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1267204,'Episode 9',NULL,'',1,84900,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-02-10',9,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1282411,'MISI: Override','Uno and his team have captured Ali and they are going to extract the I.R.I.S. out of him! Ali is determined not to let it fall to the wrong hands, while the other M.A.T.A. agents try to protect Ali. Will they succeed?','',1,83957,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rkRM6vZ4LBOH6MMtnqC7bVBugur.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2017-03-03',13,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(1292750,'Joe Ker tu?','While on the way to the TAPOPS Space Station, BoBoiBoy and the others received a distress signal from the TAPOPS Space Station, only to find that things were not always as they seem.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9vCVdrrv9e7svJFhhjcaCBlzbXv.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-03-17',7,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1297909,'Misi Penghantaran Dobi','BoBoiBoy, Fang, and Gopal are sent on a mission to deliver some bags of laundry to a client on a dangerous planet called Dargha\'ya, but it looks like someone else is ready to sabotage the mission.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gpuNCvcUp0T9ZQpK9btVgTGttz.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-03-24',8,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1343733,'Episode 1',NULL,'',1,90990,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wPQL3IefD2DTlBwk0cgdofjTDft.jpg',73107,NULL,'7.7',46,'2018-03-25',1,'2024-12-03 00:18:15','2024-12-03 00:18:15'),(1343735,'Episode 2',NULL,'',1,90990,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iFsn7UnuxYx6lIReJ4gZCuXsDfC.jpg',73107,NULL,'7.6',41,'2018-04-01',2,'2024-12-03 00:18:15','2024-12-03 00:18:15'),(1347668,'Pukauan Katakululu','BoBoiBoy, Gopal and Fang are still in Planet Dargha\'ya, trying to find the mysterious recipient and complete the mission. However, their mission is in peril when Adu Du has gone insane.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sKJfdIYhLd3OJvHvRjcN8RFWiRb.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-05-26',9,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1347669,'Ujian KENTAL','Upon returning to TAPOPS Space Station, Tarung is enraged to find that Koko Ci has hired BoBoiBoy and his friends as TAPOPS agents. With that, Tarung gives them a series of tests to ensure that they are indeed qualified to be TAPOPS agents.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o5wIOI38nRvltqyFXr6azbX6GN4.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-06-01',10,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1347670,'Pertarungan Hangat','BoBoiBoy, Yaya, Ying and Gopal go to a dangerous planet where their Toughness Test is held. They must defeat Team A and retrieve the Power Sphere hidden there.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l4hPFUW23Gmg6E3OyGloIXpS6L9.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-06-08',11,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1347671,'Si Penceroboh Panto','A thief named Panto has come to TAPOPS and stole Power- Spheras.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jNBz4xOSI0J5l9ggyFNmJReNPTJ.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-06-15',12,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1347672,'Sarkas Kegelapan','BoBoiBoy and his friends go to Planet Circus to retrieve the stolen Power Spheres and face a great clowndiator, Jugglenaut.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDsUMLL2AXTCFkp7RbPNpwZajnk.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-06-22',13,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1367159,'Episode 1',NULL,'',1,92855,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/epeh9AUQEg1787YFaHxsx5j5KSC.jpg',73952,NULL,'0',0,'2013-12-09',1,'2024-06-27 14:00:43','2024-06-27 14:00:43'),(1367160,'Episode 2',NULL,'',1,92855,NULL,73952,NULL,'0',0,'2013-12-10',2,'2024-06-27 14:00:43','2024-06-27 14:00:43'),(1377855,'Kemunculan Halilintar','The battle between BoBoiBoy and Jugglenaut continues with the return of an old friend and an old elemental power upgrade.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cWEGuTJyqUdaQMsT7wdrIgl6rNq.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-12-01',14,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1377856,'Perlumbaan Nova Prix','Admiral Tarung instructs BoBoiBoy and his friends to win the Nova Prix Space Race and get the Power Sphera named TrophyBot.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/otcQV1DP9eZcZVlpShS9DBXn93o.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-12-08',15,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1377857,'Loopa Lupa?','Admiral Tarung gives BoBoiBoy and his friends a break from TAPOPS work. They come back to Earth and decide to go for a picnic on the next day. Then they find a Power Sphere named LoopBot, having the powers to loop, which Adu Du wanted. BoBoiBoy and his friends must save LoopBot from Adu Du who wanted to do mischieves with his looping power!','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qB3T2oVzsrhujXbRxfmQe2ZpkvE.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-12-14',16,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1377858,'Gelora BoBoiBoy Air','The lava rock monster named Roktaroka came to Earth to get revenge from BoBoiBoy for destroying his house.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jlUNXDRZgvAkCW7syLdwURfx27Q.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-12-22',17,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1377859,'Dendam A.B.A.M.','In pursuit of BellBot, a robot called Accurate Ballistic Arrow Mercenary or A.B.A.M attacks Cattus\' village. BoBoiBoy and his friends must travel to Gurunda once again to battle A.B.A.M and save Cattus\' friends and family.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fHnFN4Z7no0LGBCL4WHp0SdSz2E.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2017-12-29',18,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1377860,'Pencetak Rompak','BoBoiBoy and his friends were on their way home to the TAPOPS Space Station after successfully completing a mission. However, on their way home they face problems and are forced to seek help on nearby planets. Unexpectedly, they had to deal with alien piracy criminal that were most wanted by TAPOPS.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fudvYt0Ko6gVErtJlxC1P195cwj.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2018-05-17',19,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1377861,'Manipulasi Emosi','After returning to the TAPOPS Space Station, a Power Sphere named EmotiBot has manipulated BoBoiBoy\'s friends with emotion. The situation became more aggravated as Tarung became aggressive due to uncontrollable emotions, not to mention his use of power.','',1,83849,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/chjDH5dODe2poQsnCmNVNINyRP4.jpg',69620,NULL,'0',0,'2018-05-24',20,'2024-06-27 13:23:42','2024-06-27 13:23:42'),(1403823,'Episode 1',NULL,'',2,96387,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-11-03',1,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1403824,'Episode 2',NULL,'',2,96387,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-11-10',2,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1403825,'Episode 3',NULL,'',2,96387,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-11-17',3,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1403826,'Episode 4',NULL,'',2,96387,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-11-24',4,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1403827,'Episode 5',NULL,'',2,96387,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-12-01',5,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1403828,'Episode 6',NULL,'',2,96387,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2017-12-08',6,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(1405966,'Episode 7',NULL,'',2,96387,NULL,70179,NULL,'0