e, a sentiment which is incongruent to his nature and further complicated by his inability to escape Malikâ€™s body. Black is drawn into an assault case lodged against Lokman. When Sofia realises that the case may involve the loss of innocent lives, Black once again finds himself fighting the good fight â€“ out of compassion and his growing feelings for Sofia. Meanwhile Borhan discovers that his 20 year old caseâ€™s killer may still be at large and all clues point to Seri Setia.','',2,201088,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3dpmUHvy97L8grO8squ0AehZ65y.jpg',97108,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-11',2,'2024-06-22 14:26:09','2024-06-22 14:26:09'),(3054745,'Episode 3','Black appears to be distracted from his mission to find 419, preferring to assist Sofia instead. To complicate matters, Aisya re-appears in his life - she didnâ€™t have the heart to leave him and she would like to renew their relationship. On top of that 007 and 416 have not managed to find an explanation as to why Black cannot leave Malikâ€™s body â€“ an unprecedented anomaly. Black experiences dreams about Malikâ€™s past and discovers a strange fact about his identity which he keeps a secret from Sofia.','',2,201088,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pJibFuVNMAPTJo8Bsj1aDHLQKuH.jpg',97108,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-12',3,'2024-06-22 14:26:09','2024-06-22 14:26:09'),(3054746,'Episode 4','Black helps Sofia save a close oneâ€™s life only to become embroiled in a potentially deadly  situation. It all seems related to the collapsed Seri Setia Mall. Meanwhile, Aisya is under pressure from hit man Middle Finger Man to find an elusive video tape - failure will put Malikâ€™s life at risk. Borhanâ€™s investigation shocks Borhan when he discovers that the victim in his case is someone he once knew. Lokman is devastated when he sees the extent of his brotherâ€™s greed to take over Mahkota Insurance.','',2,201088,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/apmwrzfdUEVhEBwk8kdffFevIap.jpg',97108,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-13',4,'2024-06-22 14:26:09','2024-06-22 14:26:09'),(3054747,'Episode 5','Blackâ€™s attempt to capture 419 is foiled by his faulty teleporting abilities. Meanwhile, using a file on her fatherâ€™s case, Sofia tracks his suspected murderer, walking straight into a deadly situation. Aisya discovers that Black has kept an important truth from Sofia which threatens to jeopardise their relationship. Borhan follows a lead which takes him back to Seri Setia.','',2,201088,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m0USVXwldQWhFX0FuOrvTGchFLT.jpg',97108,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-14',5,'2024-06-22 14:26:09','2024-06-22 14:26:09'),(3054748,'Episode 6','Black faces his most daunting case as he experiences emotional turmoil for the very first time â€“ the whole squad is out looking for Bagas, a.k.a Hook Scar man who has taken two people hostages, both of whom appear to be wounded. Borhan confronts Rahman about his links to insurance fraud linked to Hook Scar man. In the end, a tense stand off threatens to kill innocent lives.','',2,201088,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jesKroXWT3A1Ca30dWPmYhqU2GI.jpg',97108,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-15',6,'2024-06-22 14:26:09','2024-06-22 14:26:09'),(3054749,'Episode 7','Black receives help with his case from an unexpected source and he comes closer to finding the hostages. The situation prompts Aisya to make amends with Black. Black can no longer deny his feelings for Sofia and is conflicted as how to deal with the fate of their love. Borhan attempts to reconstruct the real target of Hook Scar Manâ€™s vendetta by trying to link up all the victims. An unexpected death offers up a clue.','',2,201088,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2UV0drPv5phO1iTR0KVzmAqDI6s.jpg',97108,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-16',7,'2024-06-22 14:26:09','2024-06-22 14:26:09'),(3054750,'Episode 8','Black and Sophia go on an all-day long date. But the shine of the day is lost when 007 and 416 have bad news for Black - the higher ups are not impressed with Black\'s lack of progress. Borhan makes a morbid discovery and realises he has at last found the smoking gun. It all points to the person he suspected all along, but shockingly he makes yet another devastating discovery.','',2,201088,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/78igBl71wnPjwOJOZd6GhX0DcS8.jpg',97108,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-17',8,'2024-06-22 14:26:09','2024-06-22 14:26:09'),(3082390,'Episode 9','Black finds himself uncovering a gruesome revelation from the past. Despite having to make haste over his search for 419 he is side-tracked by a 20 year old murder which inexplicably devastates him. The secret of his identity is also under threat and he finds himself racing against time and heart break. Sofia too uncovers a buried family secret that sends her reeling.','',2,201088,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i4lSp8swuAhLvxYCIsHUAXQF4Ia.jpg',97108,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-18',9,'2024-06-22 14:26:09','2024-06-22 14:26:09'),(3082391,'Episode 10','Black is determined to exact justice over the lives lost and ruined by a still at-large criminal. In a daring sting he weeds out the culprit â€“ only to exacerbate matters resulting in a deadly stand-off. Meanwhile 419 is no where in sight. Black mourns losing Sofia â€“ their love story seemingly doomed to end.','',2,201088,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eEIACWXrKPw52QridvU8NHLywWK.jpg',97108,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-19',10,'2024-06-22 14:26:09','2024-06-22 14:26:09'),(3278878,'Episode 1',NULL,'',6,215384,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2021-05-27',1,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(3278879,'Episode 2',NULL,'',6,215384,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-03',2,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(3278880,'Episode 3',NULL,'',6,215384,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-10',3,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(3278881,'Episode 4',NULL,'',6,215384,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-17',4,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(3278882,'Episode 5',NULL,'',6,215384,NULL,70179,NULL,'0',0,'2021-06-24',5,'2024-07-11 15:58:18','2024-09-16 12:40:18'),(3278883,'Episode 6',NULL,'',