J3ewxSNMxwhRUZrwK.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2022-12-12',2,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4134993,'A Scary Screw-Up','Amato and Pian try to rehabilitate the bad robots but an accident gives the bad robot Scarescrew a chance to escape.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eVmtq9xqgMFoLttufPuneTXdJfE.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2022-12-19',3,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4134994,'Mechanizer World','Amato\'s Mechanizer has been taken over by King Boxell. To stop him, the kids have to enter the digital Mechanizer World.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9fEJHHUoo46tXgm0nzfKUnbamyY.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2022-12-26',4,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4134996,'A Dangerous Game','Amato and friends visit a newly reopened game arcade, but unknown to them it\'s a trap laid by the bad robot Arcada.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sjXTcbF9qzzoZPwJAFNBN5ugSkJ.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2022-12-26',5,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4134998,'Plastic Bottle Royale','While searching for plastic bottles for their class project, Amato and friends meet a recycling robot made from plastic.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a1av6ps1nan2zgwK7jgtTpQe94H.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2022-12-26',6,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4134999,'The Destar Prix Race','Amato recounts the story of when CarBro and JetSis crashed the previous year\'s Destar Prix go-kart race.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6LgbWlrjeuDXUnQ4FoMkzdHcyj0.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2022-12-31',7,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4135001,'Cone-Nichi Wa!','Amato gets news that the Konchozoku are stirring up trouble, and they\'re so bad even the Cone Kochos are scared of them.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/siSgj9Vqb7q7mWfImvkCrb5NhP6.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-01',8,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4135002,'Moody Weather','The bad robot Cloudiva is causing freak weather events around town. Amato has to stop her, before things get even worse.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9XIQjvIf1BcFEylsLIhkwiFDSPq.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-07',9,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4135003,'Board Game Empire','Amato and friends find a mysterious board game which transports them into its world, and the only way out is to win.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oFoaqa9LIAkbCS4CkqL2ocfxf4H.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-08',10,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4135004,'The Toopee Show','Amato and MechaBot are invited to a children\'s show hosted by squirrel mascot Toopee, but things get weird really fast.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4KJPqubuXdH2nXIjpN6dBS8WaZ.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-14',11,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4135005,'Out Of This Worm: Part 1','Amato\'s attempt to capture the bad robot Shleep is thwarted by the arrival of an alien named Chachix.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5HETKvedzbQPEG1Ax0SdL5LDDxo.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-15',12,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4135006,'Out Of This Worm: Part 2','The bad robots are loose and Chachix plans to capture and control them all. Amato has to stop Chachix once and for all.','',2,322515,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4vZF2MJgnQBBkVVUZChIMsIjYUx.jpg',153832,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-15',13,'2024-06-28 11:16:12','2024-06-28 11:16:12'),(4135314,'MISI: Hybrid','Disappointed by his poor performance in the team challenge, Ali appeals to Rizka, Mika and Iman, all former Kombat Ejens, to improve his training.','',3,298831,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j0qgOvIiuFBI64NzTd5X4OGU9rl.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2022-12-31',9,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(4149656,'MISI: Perkhemahan','The Mentors declare a day off for the remaining Arena competitors - a camping night out where eliminated young Ejens are included.','',3,298831,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xcK3JQr83lcob4C9GsX5zHnHQ4f.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-07',10,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(4168157,'Manifesto','Pelajar bermasalah Fakhri mendaftar di sekolah berasrama penuh berprestij lelaki, KUDRAT. Di dalam, dia mendedahkan organisasi jahat yang mengawal pelajar dan bersatu semula dengan abangnya Naim yang terasing.','',1,324823,NULL,218507,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-23',1,'2024-07-01 08:32:56','2024-09-02 03:18:32'),(4168173,'Of Mice & Men','Fakhri dan rakan-rakan asramanya terus dijerubu oleh High Council dan mereka mula mengetahui akibat daripada snitches.','',1,324823,NULL,218507,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-30',2,'2024-07-01 08:32:56','2024-09-02 03:18:32'),(4168174,'Bad Roots','Fakhri mendapat kunjungan mengejut daripada ibunya semasa dia membuat persediaan untuk kejohanan itu. Dia juga membuka cerita tentang masa lalunya dan masalah yang timbul 6 tahun lalu yang menyebabkan dia berjauhan dengan Naim.','',1,324823,NULL,218507,NULL,'0',0,'2023-02-06',3,'2024-07-01 08:32:56','2024-09-02 03:18:32'),(4168175,'Laid Bare','Kelas Tingkatan 4 menghadapi ketakutan terburuk mereka apabila mereka menghadiri \"Kem Bulan Madu\" tahunan.','',1,324823,NULL,218507,NULL,'0',0,'2023-02-13',4,'2024-07-01 08:32:56','2024-09-02 03:18:32'),(4168176,'Ashes to Ashes','Syak wasangka Encik Sin dan Puan Faniza timbul apabila pelajar Tingkatan 4 kembali sakit selepas \"Kem Bulan Madu\" & Fakhri yang marah menghadap Kahar untuk menamatkan perintah zalim oleh senior.','',1,324823,NULL,218507,NULL,'0',0,'2023-02-20',5,'2024-07-01 08:32:56','2024-09-02 03:18:32'),(4168177,'Predators','Naim membongkar rahsia gelap yang walaupun pelajar tidak sedar apabila Amirr mendedahkan masa lalunya yang traumatik.','',1,324823,NULL,218507,NULL,'0',0,'2023-02-27',6,'2024-07-01 08:32:56','2024-09-02 03:18:32'),(4168179,'Tumbuk Dinding','Kecurigaan pihak sekolah meningkat berikutan kes Ariz. Hubungan Naim dan Mia semakin mekar. Sementara itu, Fakhriah mula hilang genggaman terhadap matlamat murninya apabila kuasa mula merosakkannya.','',1,324823,NULL,218507,NULL,'0',0,'2023-03-06',7,'2024-07-01 08:32:56','2024-09-02 03:18:32'),(4168180,'Kerajaan Lalat','Pemerintahan Kahar mula goyah apabila pelajar Tingkatan 4 bertindak balas terhadapnya kerana pengaruh Fakhri. Tekanan meningkat antara pelajar Tingkatan 5 dan Tingkatan 4.','',1,324823,NULL,218507,NULL,'0',0,'2023-03-13',8,'2024-07-01 08:32:56','2024-09-02 03:18:32'),(4168181,'Cermin','Pihak sekolah membuka siasatan berikutan kes Ayam. Sementara rasa bersalah Fakhri membebani dirinya, Prakash menggesa Fakhri untuk menghentikan pergaduhannya yang akan datang dengan Naim sebelum terlambat.','',1,324823,NULL,218507,NULL,'0',0,'2023-03-11',9,'2024-07-01 08:32:56','2024-09-02 03:18:32'),(4168182,'Ikrar','Kebenaran suram terbongkar. Keadaan sekolah, tradisinya, serta masa depan Fakhri dan Naim berada di barisan apabila pengakuan terbongkar.','',1,324823,NULL,218507,NULL,'0',0,'2023-03-20',10,'2024-07-01 08:32:56','2024-09-02 03:18:32'),(4170657,'MISI: Vital','Ali gears up as one of the Top 4 finalists in the MATA Arena Final Challenge, where they\'re surprised by the attendance of MATA Pillar Leaders.','',3,298831,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zKo2RFmL0enhyFU18YJWxVQqHGE.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-14',11,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(4190746,'MISI: Sengat','Ali\'s quest in the MATA Arena Final Challenge is interrupted when Cinco breaks into its top-secret location and reveals her master plan.','',3,298831,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c6xqrtxRRsj26qnzkRFNghtjhOy.jpg',69676,NULL,'0',0,'2023-01-21',12,'2024-06-27 14:24:37','2024-06-27 14:49:35'),(4191945,'Episode 1',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-09-26',1,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4191946,'Episode 2',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-09-26',2,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4191947,'Episode 3',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'