curs Granny\'s wrath. As punishment, she scatters them in the forest. Each must now find their way back to the mansion on their own, but the forest holds its own dangers.','',1,328184,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1yz7G2uZbtjKH6Xm28ewGXSBMcH.jpg',220080,NULL,'0',0,'2023-02-16',3,'2024-06-28 14:03:23','2024-06-28 14:03:23'),(4222951,'Come Out, Come Out, Wherever You Are','The group realises their only chance of getting home is to play the Master\'s game, but the stakes are higher than they realise. However, Zamir has a different idea.','',1,328184,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3F5K53i2mdGXNNqXhP4o1DOxY5d.jpg',220080,NULL,'0',0,'2023-02-23',4,'2024-06-28 14:03:23','2024-06-28 14:03:23'),(4222955,'The  Beauty and The Feast','The Master has allowed Zamir to return to the outside world, but why? Meanwhile, those left behind discover Granny\'s biggest secret.','',1,328184,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eUWzyfL5kFf8a6IYWHJDoFOnBQP.jpg',220080,NULL,'0',0,'2023-03-02',5,'2024-06-28 14:03:23','2024-06-28 14:03:23'),(4222959,'It Comes From Below','Alis, Adi, Malia and Sani are forced to decide -- who will be the Master\'s next meal? In the outside world, Samira makes the ultimate sacrifice to protect her family.','',1,328184,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kOjLOHrDXgYweW26raAuc2gGIaW.jpg',220080,NULL,'0',0,'2023-03-09',6,'2024-06-28 14:03:23','2024-06-28 14:03:23'),(4222960,'Monster Among Us','A furious Granny sets about finding Samira\'s killer. Fear and suspicion run high when the hostages discover the truth about Mior\'s death.','',1,328184,NULL,220080,NULL,'0',0,'2023-03-16',7,'2024-06-28 14:03:23','2024-06-28 14:03:23'),(4222961,'Eenie Meenie Minie Mo','Granny convinces Zamir that the only way to save his brother is for Zamir to take Granny\'s place as the Master\'s servant. But to prove his worth, he must feed one of his friends to the monster.','',1,328184,NULL,220080,NULL,'0',0,'2023-03-23',8,'2024-06-28 14:03:23','2024-06-28 14:03:23'),(4222962,'Devil In The Details','Furious at being tricked by Granny, Zamir discovers Samira\'s diary which may hold the key to their escape. Adi, Alis and Malia realise that the Zamir they knew is gone and prepare to fight him.','',1,328184,NULL,220080,NULL,'0',0,'2023-03-30',9,'2024-06-28 14:03:23','2024-06-28 14:03:23'),(4222963,'Finale : All Is Lost','Adi, Alis and Malia have finally escaped from the dimension, but each must reckon with their past sins. Meanwhile, Zamir remains trapped in the mansion, doomed as the Master\'s servant. Will this nightmare ever end?','',1,328184,NULL,220080,NULL,'0',0,'2023-03-30',10,'2024-06-28 14:03:23','2024-06-28 14:03:23'),(4228154,'Episode 10',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-03',10,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4228155,'Episode 11',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-03',11,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4228156,'Episode 12',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-04',12,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4228157,'Episode 13',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-04',13,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4228158,'Episode 14',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-05',14,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4228159,'Episode 15',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-05',15,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4228160,'Episode 16',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-06',16,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4228161,'Episode 17',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-06',17,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4228162,'Episode 18',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-10',18,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4228163,'Episode 19',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-10',19,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47:14'),(4230425,'Episode 20',NULL,'',24,326137,NULL,1790,NULL,'0',0,'2022-10-11',20,'2024-09-15 13:42:25','2024-09-15 13:47: