istrations to site in past 24 hours.\n(! | / | @)nerdbot uploads - Displays # of uploads to site in past 24 hours.\n(! | / | @)nerdbot warnings - Displays # of H&amp;R warnings issued on site in past 24 hours.\n\n(! | / | @)nerdbot leeched - Displays the top leeched torrent on the site.\n(! | / | @)nerdbot seeded - Displays the seeded torrent on the site.\n(! | / | @)nerdbot snatched - Displays the top snatched torrent on the site.\n\nEcho &amp; Private commands:\n\nNone.\n\n(All NerdBot statistics are cached for 60 minutes)','2024-11-26 13:12:40','2024-11-26 13:12:40'),(6216,3,1,NULL,NULL,'!nerdbot registrations','2024-11-26 13:13:45','2024-11-26 13:13:45'),(6217,1,1,NULL,2,'In the last 24 hours, 46 users have registered to MalayaBits!','2024-11-26 13:13:45','2024-11-26 13:13:45'),(6218,1,1,NULL,1,'It\'s a bird! It\'s a plane! Nevermind, it\'s just [url=https://malayabits.cc/users/domingong]domingong[/url].','2024-11-26 13:14:55','2024-11-26 13:14:55'),(6219,1,1,NULL,1,'A wild [url=https://malayabits.cc/users/luphaxio]luphaxio[/url] appeared.','2024-11-26 13:16:24','2024-11-26 13:16:24'),(6220,1,1,NULL,1,'A wild [url=https://malayabits.cc/users/kans]kans[/url] appeared.','2024-11-26 13:18:35','2024-11-26 13:18:35'),(6221,1,1,NULL,1,'Welcome to MalayaBits [url=https://malayabits.cc/users/arrive2024]arrive2024[/url]. We were expecting you.','2024-11-26 13:20:24','2024-11-26 13:20:24'),(6222,1,1,NULL,1,'It\'s a bird! It\'s a plane! Nevermind, it\'s just [url=https://malayabits.cc/users/rotorknotten]rotorknotten[/url].','2024-11-26 13:26:28','2024-11-26 13:26:28'),(6223,1,1,NULL,1,'[url=https://malayabits.cc/users/unknowngamer]unknowngamer[/url] has arrived. Party\'s over.','2024-11-26 13:27:23','2024-11-26 13:27:23'),(6224,1,1,NULL,1,'Welcome to MalayaBits [url=https://malayabits.cc/users/gudnight]gudnight[/url]. We were expecting you.','2024-11-26 13:29:04','2024-11-26 13:29:04'),(6225,1,1,NULL,1,'[url=https://malayabits.cc/users/boualemdz]boualemdz[/url], We\'ve bee