pped off when Sazali and his gang committed burglary. Sazali was shot but managed to escape and seek shelter in his father\'s home. What did Hassan do?','0.887','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qYuiY6YizZkXiYjP6oC6AXmMmES.jpg','1956-10-27','0','137','Released','','6',1,'2024-06-27 12:38:18','2024-06-27 12:38:18',NULL),(70223,NULL,'0216602','Bujang Lapok','Bujang Lapok','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wzWn1MFgAGZ29VDgtP3grskquC2.jpg','0','','Bujang Lapok','','2.292','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hiLcooHtEwgNkjv7fOlzxzMWPdP.jpg','1957-11-30','0','95','Released','','6',3,'2024-07-14 21:32:08','2024-07-14 21:32:08',NULL),(70224,NULL,'0278067','Sumpah Orang Minyak','Sumpah Orang Minyak','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kv8pYQCLUB7AFkH3Ce1EIiIxWCW.jpg','0','','Sumpah Orang Minyak','','1.526','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wvrMRUoR6X2AKD9LBZTQGryx6Nc.jpg','1956-04-20','0','91','Released','','7',2,'2024-08-03 09:09:55','2024-08-03 09:09:55',NULL),(70225,NULL,'0277908','Musang Berjanggut','Musang Berjanggut','ms',0,NULL,'0','','Musang Berjanggut','','2.549','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cqHXC95ahqrSAaNxBD2QbAOj6iQ.jpg','1959-08-01','0','127','Released','','8',1,'2024-07-14 22:07:35','2024-07-14 22:07:35',NULL),(70227,NULL,'0277929','Nujum Pak Belalang','Nujum Pak Belalang','ms',0,NULL,'0','','Nujum Pak Belalang','','5.305','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rcwroUjJfTDFVMrX8DRXB6kuuKJ.jpg','1959-12-26','0','111','Released','','8',1,'2024-07-14 21:53:50','2024-07-14 21:53:50',NULL),(70228,NULL,'0277950','Pendekar Bujang Lapok','Pendekar Bujang Lapok','ms',0,NULL,'0','','Pendekar Bujang Lapok','','0.823','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fFIql8PPnOsgWFtCRfm2I0vBFtk.jpg','1959-03-21','0','105','Released','','7',1,'2024-07-18 13:49:16','2024-07-18 13:49:56',NULL),(70229,NULL,'0277563','Ali Baba Bujang Lapok','Ali Baba Bujang Lapok','ms',0,NULL,'0','','Ali Baba Bujang Lapok','','2.307','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dYSuQv