7',1,'2024-07-01 06:24:45','2024-07-10 20:40:51',NULL),(209384,NULL,'0277089','Lagi Lagi Senario','Lagi Lagi Senario','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oxzu1CGFciWWzu6bkLoDsBfm2rk.jpg','0','','Lagi Lagi Senario','Wahid menjadi mangsa kelembapan ekonomi yang mengakibatkan dia bekerja sebagai pelayan di sebuah \'warung\' milik Azlee. Di sana dia berkawan dengan Yassin dan Saiful yang juga bekerja di situ. Tetapi masalah timbul apabila perniagaan Azlee berkembang pesat, berkat kebolehan Saiful membuat \'roti canai\' yang sedap. Bagaimanapun, masalah datang dalam bentuk Mazlan, yang secara terbuka mencabar \'warung\' Azlee dengan membuka \'warung\'nya sendiri, tepat di sebelah Azlee. Mazlan juga berjaya memikat Saiful dan Yassin untuk bekerja untuknya. Melihat perniagaan Azlee semakin teruk, Wahid menawarkan diri untuk dilatih sebagai pembuat \'roti canai\' yang baru dan telah tampil dengan gimik bernas untuk mendapatkan kembali pelanggan mereka. Rancangan Wahid berjaya tetapi tidak sebelum Mazlan mempunyai apa-apa untuk dikatakan mengenainya...','6.489','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zHPbGqsb25zvXLbgg90hyuHSnm4.jpg','2001-12-11','0','110','Released','','6',1,'2024-07-01 05:43:30','2024-07-10 19:51:26',NULL),(209422,NULL,'0270640','Senario Lagi','Senario Lagi','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c427iHzRvwu5OmaOr9sVOPWOrI4.jpg','0','','Senario Lagi','Kisahnya bermula dengan Azlee memperdagangkan Kancil comelnya dengan sebuah Proton Wira melalui jurujual bernama Borhan. Azlee bercadang untuk membawa isterinya Zati dan anak mereka Zizi ke Cherating. Selepas Azlee pergi, Borhan bertemu dengan bouncer bernama Mazlan yang sedang mencari Proton Wira yang sama dengan harapan untuk mendapatkannya semula. Mazlan yang nekad untuk mendapatkan semula kereta itu diberitahu Azlee memilikinya. Sementara itu, Azlee dan keluarganya dihalang oleh seorang warga Indonesia bernama Yassin di sepanjang lebuh raya Karak. Yassin mahu menaiki lif ke Kuantan tetapi ditolak oleh Azlee. Beberapa meter jauhnya, seorang gadis cantik Linda menahan Azlee kerana keretanya rosak. Azlee memberi Linda tumpangan ke bandar dan ini menimbulkan kemarahan Zati. Pertengkaran berlaku dan Azlee secara tidak sengaja merempuh Saiful menaiki motosikal....','4.592','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9zywyaIa9vTasKgg1bAEScgENNQ.jpg','2000-05-23','0','118','Released','','5',1,'2024-07-01 10:37:44','2024-07-27 08:49:48',NULL),(213611,NULL,'1693910','Setinggan','Setinggan','ms',0,NULL,'0','','Setinggan','','0.531','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dcqHtvSNK6DejhIyIdPnIA68GVy.jpg','1981-01-01','0','90','Released','','0',0,'2024-09-27 22:06:07','2024-09-27 22:06:59',NULL),(217584,NULL,'3056608','KL Gangster 2','KL Gangster 2','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/onIS5SnzaRv9WHwYQ9VQA08iA1c.jpg','0','','KL Gangster 2','','10.529','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3gT9VyxUZ2ue3MUsx4R3snHXVdw.jpg','2013-10-02','0','110','Released','','7.5',10,'2024-07-08 12:51:27','2024-07-08 12:51:36',NULL),(217819,NULL,'3145670','Adnan Sempit 3','Adnan Sempit 3','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f2WKrE1nyB5L7RekgK3bJqQJivE.jpg','0','','Adnan Sempit 3','The third instalment of \"Adnan Sempit\" sees Adnan married to his childhood love, Nadia, and Bobby married to Wawa. Adnan, is also getting the hang of running his own business. However, the two couples soon realise that there is more to getting married than just sharing a home with someone.','1.831','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mmPleEIiWJvFUoCuQgcuJCorYUx.jpg','2013-08-07','0','83','Released','Gua dah tak sempit der...!','0',0,'2024-06-25 13:25:35','2024-06-25 13:25:35','qVyH9YGgX2E'),(217831,NULL,'1573785','Adnan Sempit','Adnan Sempit','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b3GlC2tbtR6SAA0kfmG3otz4guS.jpg','0','','Adnan Sempit','Known as Nan Sempit by his friends, Adnan (Shaheizy Sam) is an orphan and a \'mat rempit\' who decides to move to the big city in Kuala Lumpur after being treated unfairly by his aunt\'s family. During his stay in KL, Adnan lives with his elder brother Macha (Cat Farish) and works as a dispatch guy at a private company. He develops a friendly relationship with his boss, Nadia (Intan Ladyana) who comes from a very wealthy family. Soon, their relationship turns sour when an argument breaks open between Adnan and Zack.','1.296','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3OESK9ccHPxsvlTCddMIkHboZHw.jpg','2010-01-13','0','83','Released','Di mana ada kemahuan, di situ ada HIGHWAY','5.5',2,'2024-06-25 13:15:31','2024-06-25 13:15:31',NULL),(217927,NULL,'0270745','XX Ray','XX Ray','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hOfI5yiHNOxJYFTRJZI2Xj6KNkh.jpg','0','','XX Ray','','0.696','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4LZnlDkLAPlHgPrXNbWx2TcV6Fe.jpg','1992-12-23','0','116','Released','','6.3',3,'2024-10-20 11:46:56','2024-10-20 11:49:25',NULL),(217928,NULL,'0270746','XX Ray II','XX Ray II','ms',0,NULL,'0','','XX Ray II','','0.989','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uGITVUMpIwtwJJMTZRGBXCYr8J7.jpg','1995-11-24','0','103','Released','','8',2,'2024-10-20 11:43:26','2024-10-20 11:49:06',NULL),(217930,NULL,'3132450','KL Zombi','KL Zombi','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oLezuoQfCmxdg2jRrkwGADvohUt.jpg','0','','KL Zombi','','3.581','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rGMmc9eC3mVqsRcbvzKzdtksZH4.jpg','2013-08-29','0','97','Released','','6.3',11,'2024-07-10 11:03:49','2024-07-10 11:03:49',NULL),(218767,NULL,'0145792','Gila-Gila Remaja','Gila-Gila Remaja','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8xeDEIUnRRsZr3NHS7R3ua4BZd5.jpg','0','','Gila-Gila Remaja','','3.528','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6xQ0ld7J67WVaBLqYqoKPOapOSk.jpg','1985-09-03','0','160','Released','','10',1,'2024-07-02 16:15:09','2024-07-02 16:15:09',NULL),(220139,NULL,'3145734','Paku Pontianak','Paku Pontianak','en',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5GBSzJcUOjtvbeq0PkkfMR89pbX.jpg','0','','Paku Pontianak','','1.896','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A1T5qF