my/film/info/?id=Adik_Manja_393','Adik Manja','A young teacher, Azmi is offered teaching post at a girl\'s school. The reaction from the students is quite hilarious as tis is the first time a male teacher has been posted to the school. Just before reporting for duty, he stumbles upon a baby which has been abandoned at a clinic. He takes the baby with him and the presence of the baby amuses the students and others teachers. However, one teacher, Bedah, dislikes Azmi and tries everything she can to get rid of him. Azmi get the help of another teacher, Sharina and some students to baby-sit. Azmiâ€™s freindship with Sharina is miscountrued and malicious gossips begin to spread that the baby is actually their love child. At the same time, a jilted student tries to commit suicide.','1.444','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jdgur0oVF0pr6J2v6IzncwqAxFu.jpg','1980-01-01','0','100','Released','','4',1,'2024-06-25 15:52:12','2024-06-25 15:52:12',NULL),(246071,NULL,'0312406','Azura','Azura','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jywKNS9rq1Ed5xBmHZVGS8b1WVX.jpg','0','','Azura','','2.437','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4n7Efk6Hfd9nTiku4vqxND7Wx0a.jpg','1984-12-13','0','113','Released','','4',1,'2024-08-12 09:44:01','2024-08-12 09:44:33',NULL),(246533,NULL,'1156285','Anak Halal','Anak Halal','ms',0,NULL,'0','http://cinemamalaysia.com.my/film/info/?id=Anak_Halal_567','Anak Halal','Hisham, a drug dealer, finds himself stuck in a situation where he had to hand over his young son to a homeless woman. Hisham is caught and jailed. Mariam, who is a few cans short of a six pack raises the baby, now named after the famed legend â€œIndraputraâ€, in very meager circumstances, but full of love and art. They live in a squatter area and have neighbors named Bu Leha and Putraâ€™s best friend, Johanna.  They move to Kuala Lumpur in hopes of a better life, but Putra and Johanna inevitably grow up to be street kids, tough and full of conflict. They live hand to mouth, but at the same time their poverty does not stop them from having strong friendships and at times, to enjoy their youth.','2.167','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1TkI9L6rtXaoPcONni4EyCsV9h.jpg','2007-12-13','0','115','Released','kisah realiti kepincangan masyarakat [social upheavals of reality story]','6',1,'2024-06-27 12:33:31','2024-06-27 12:33:31','gMVgbgnCpqQ'),(247160,NULL,'1143095','1957 Hati Malaya','1957 Hati Malaya','ms',0,NULL,'0','','1957 Hati Malaya','','1.707','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jud8Urfhijltan20NzHDxad8udH.jpg','2007-10-25','0','0','Released','','0',0,'2024-08-13 11:30:30','2024-08-13 12:37:40',NULL),(248943,NULL,'','Lela Manja','Lela Manja','en',0,NULL,'0','','Lela Manja','','2.415','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cfMoXpP1ACKR7MzgkPC36kYetVA.jpg','1960-01-01','0','0','Released','','0',0,'2024-07-17 16:27:15','2024-07-17 16:27:15',NULL),(249087,NULL,'9815072','Pontianak Menjerit','Pontianak Menjerit','en',0,NULL,'0','','Pontianak Menjerit','','1.212','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cEqx5uY5PN3wcmQJU1HFkFyv5BP.jpg','2005-01-16','0','105','Released','','5',1,'2024-11-05 11:32:32','2024-11-05 11:32:50',NULL),(249244,NULL,'0309450','Cinta 200 Ela','Cinta 200 Ela','en',0,NULL,'0','','Cinta 200 Ela','','0.431',NULL,'2002-12-06','0','0','Released','','0',0,'2024-08-24 09:43:12','2024-08-24 09:44:28',NULL),(249247,NULL,'1573799','Cinta Fotokopi','Cinta Fotokopi','en',0,NULL,'0','','Cinta Fotokopi','','1.176',NULL,'2005-04-21','0','100','Released','','0',0,'2024-07-05 16:37:31','2024-07-05 16:37:31',NULL),(249551,NULL,'1606214','Evolusi KL Drift','Evolusi KL Drift','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e2WD3bAxCAb3S7IWqX8Rp8rWv2t.jpg','0','','Evolusi KL Drift','','2.83','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jdU23XTAOKvZUtMfJ3oWLxbIHAU.jpg','2008-04-03','0','101','Released','','5.8',4,'2024-07-05 20:56:50','2024-07-16 13:09:50',NULL),(249589,NULL,'1606215','Evolusi KL Drift 2','Evolusi KL Drift 2','ms',0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origina