INSERT INTO `pages` VALUES (1,'Rules','[b]General Rules[/b]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Follow the Staff\'s orders and respect their decisions\r\n[*]Respect each other. No hate speech, no trolling, no offending of other users. Only positive criticism is allowed\r\n[*]Malay and English the only allowed language for public chats, posts and comments\r\n[*]Any action that is directly or indirectly harmful to the tracker and/or its members will result in your account getting banned\r\n[*]Do not spam the chat box or the forum\r\n[*]No download/upload boosting/cheating\r\n[*]Modified Torrent Clients are not allowed\r\n[*]You accept our Terms of Usage by creating an account on MalayaBits\r\n[*]We (MalayaBits team) are not responsible for any content linked on this website\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n[b]Seeding / Hit and Run (HnR)[/b]\r\n\r\n[u]General[/u]\r\nSeeding from Debrid (and similar services) is not allowed\r\n\r\n[u]Seeding Requirements[/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]You must seed downloaded torrents at least for 1 day (24h) as soon as you downloaded more than 10% of a torrent, regardless of ratio\r\n[*]Seedtime requirements apply to all torrents (no matter if they are free or global FreeLeech is active)\r\n[*]You do not have to seed your torrent 24/7, but you must fill the required seed time within 10 days after downloading\r\n[*]We do not recommend partial Downloads! Seedtime starts counting as soon as you have 100% downloaded\r\n[*]All completed requests are subject to extended seedtime requirements for requested content\r\n[*]Earn bonus points while seeding longer than the required seed time\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[u]Hit and Run (HnR)[/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]If you do not follow these rules, you will be warned (HnR Warning)\r\n[*]After 3 (unsatisfied) active HnR warnings, your Download permissions will be revoked\r\n[*]After 5 (unsatisfied) active HnR warnings, you will get banned from MalayaBits\r\n[*]Active HnR warnings will expire after 14 days or once seeded off, but will always be recorded in your warning history\r\n[*]You must keep a ratio of at least 0.4 otherwise your download privileges will be revoked. Your buffer at the top of the page shows how much you can download without falling below 0.4\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[i]Keep those torrents alive and seed for as long as you can![/i]\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n[b]Account Rules[/b]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Do not create multiple accounts\r\n[*]One account per person per lifetime\r\n[*]Adult content in your profile picture or custom user icon is not allowed\r\n[*]You must log in once every 90 days to prevent your account from getting disabled\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[u]Invites[/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]You are responsible for your invitee\r\n[*]Do only invite people you trust\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n[b]Chat Rules[/b]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Be polite\r\n[*]Extreme, rude, or racist expressions are strictly prohibited\r\n[*]Do not spam the chat\r\n[*]Do not change your display name\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n[b]Request Rules[/b]<br>\r\nRequests are meant to request content that does not exist on MalayaBits yet.\r\n\r\n[u]Seeding Requirements[/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Upon approval of a filled request, the requester must complete the download\r\n[*]All filled requests are subject to extended seedtime requirements for requested content: Once downloaded, you must seed your requested content for 10 days!\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[u]Creating new requests[/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Requests breaking the Request Rules will be deleted and the assigned bounty will be lost\r\n[*]Keep your request general\r\n[*]You are not allowed to alter your request after creating it, except for fixing typos or similar\r\n[*]Do not request something that has not aired/is not (fully) released yet\r\n[*]You may request a specific release group, but only if you specify the reason (valid reasons include: quality, size, source, extra audio tracks, etc.) you want it\r\n[*]Requesting single TV episodes is only allowed for airing seasons. Otherwise, request the whole season\r\n[*]Only 1 title per request (multiple TV seasons should be requested separately)\r\n[*]Foreign content must contain an English dub track, English subtitles, or both\r\n[*]Requests for torrents breaking the rules are not allowed (e.g. requesting a movie with redundant foreign audio tracks)\r\n[*]Pending requests will be automatically approved by the system after 3 weeks\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[u]Filling requests[/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Request comments are only meant to be a place to ask questions about this specific request. Like \"I got X, would you accept it?\" or \"What audio do you prefer?\" and so on\r\n[*]Fill any request to the best of our knowledge and belief\r\n[*]After claiming a request, you have 7 days to upload and fulfill it\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n\r\n[u]Automatic Cleanup[/u]\r\nUnfilled requests older than 1 year are to be automatically pruned by the system (including filled requests older than 1 year that become open again)\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n[b]Upload Rules[/b]<br>\r\n[u]Content Rules[/u]<br>\r\nAllowed content\r\n[list]\r\n[*]ONLY CONTENT PRODUCE FROM OR BY MALAYSIA ARE ALLOWED HERE\r\n[*]Movies/TV Shows that are listed on TMDB\r\n[*]Commercially available music (exceptions could be made for freely available music under staff approval)\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\nProhibited content:\r\n\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Extra files besides the Movie/Show/Music, such as NFO\'s, screenshots, subtitles, samples. Exceptions can be allowed for Anime\'s\r\n[*]Compressed, archived, or password-protected formats\r\n[*]Pre-releases or bootlegged content, such as CAM, TS, TC, R5, DVDScr\r\n[*]Modified/Compressed SD content\r\n[*]Content having defects such as: incomplete, bad aspect ratio, artifacts/glitches in video, playback issues, out of sync audio or subs, watermarked, poor cropping, etc. If in doubt, ask in the Forum\r\n[*]Social Media Content\r\n[*]Fan edits, cuts, and restoration projects\r\n[*]Non-official Upscales\r\n[*]Any kind of Movie/Theme packs\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n[b]Naming[/b]<br>\r\nMust follow the approved MalayaBits naming scheme. Details and examples are located in our Upload Guide\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n[b]Description, MediaInfo Rules[/b]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]All uploads must include 3+ screenshots uploaded to an image hoster and added with BBCode\r\n[*]All uploads must include MediaInfo added into the MediaInfo parser box. In case of Full-Disc, BDInfo is required but not MediaInfo\r\n[*]Do not edit/modify the MediaInfo/BDInfo text\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\nDisclaimer\r\nWe understand that the upload rules cannot possibly cover 100% of all situations, in other situations the MalayaBits team has the final call on all upload decisions, we ask that you please respect the MalayaBits teams decisions. Thank you.','2024-06-22 14:17:29','2024-07-16 12:15:00'),(2,'FAQ','[u][b]Can I use a VPN?[/b][/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Yes. We respect your privacy and do not log IP information.\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[u][b]How do I contact MalayaBits?[/b][/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]For assistance, please use our [url=https://malayabits.cc/tickets]Helpdesk[/url]\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[u][b]What are the different user classes and how do I get promoted?[/b][/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]User = Standard user, less than 50GB Upload\r\n[*]PowerUser = 500GB Upload and account 1 month old\r\n[*]SuperUser = 1TiB Upload and account 2 months old\r\n[*]ExtremeUser = 3TiB Upload and account 3 months old\r\n[*]InsaneUser = 5TiB Upload and account 6 months old\r\n[*]Seeder = Seedsize >= 5TiB, account 1 months old and seedtime average 30 days or better\r\n[*]Veteran = 10TiB Upload and account 1 year old\r\n[*]Archivist = Seedsize >= 10TiB, account 3 months old and seedtime average 60 days or better\r\n[*]Uploader = Only granted by staff to role model uploaders\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[u][b]What are the perks of each usergroup?[/b][/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*][url=https://malayabits.cc/stats/groups/requirements/]Usergroup Perks[/url]\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\nYou can also see the amount of each user group that has achieved the awesome perks/upgrades too.\r\n[list]\r\n[*][url=https://malayabits.cc/stats/groups/]Users[/url]\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[u][b]What is the minimum ratio required?[/b][/u]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]0.4\r\n[/list]','2024-06-22 14:17:29','2024-07-27 00:07:47'),(3,'Suggested Clients','We suggest the following BitTorrent clients.','2024-06-22 14:17:29','2024-06-22 14:17:29'),(4,'Upload Guide','[b]Prerequisites:[/b]\r\n[spoiler]Before you start, you will need several things:\r\n\r\n[list]\r\n[*]The file(s) you wish to upload.\r\n[*]A torrent client (you probably have this already).\r\n[*]Software capable of creating a torrent. qBitttorrent, rutorrent, mktorrent, and torrenttools are popular choices.\r\n[*][url=https://mediaarea.net/en/MediaInfo]Mediainfo Software.[/url]\r\n[*]Software to take screenshots. mpv and ffmpeg are recommended.\r\n[/list]\r\nThe file(s) you choose to upload should not be renamed or modified from their original release whenever possible. Additionally, you should avoid extra \"junk\" files, like .NFOs, samples, images, etc.\r\n[/spoiler]\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n[b]1. Creating a Torrent File[/b]\r\n[spoiler]Before you create the torrent, you will want to grab your personal announce url from [url=https://malayabits.cc/torrents/create?category_id=1]upload page[/url].\r\n\r\nOnce you have that, choose one of the below methods to create the torrent.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\nqBittorrent:\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Navigate to Tools > Torrent Creator in the top bar. A new window will open. If you have a single file, then select the file using the Select file button. Likewise, if you have a multiple files in a folder, use the Select Folder button.\r\n[*]Then, ensure that Torrent Format is V1 and the Private Torrent option is checked.\r\n[*]Next, choose a piece size as Auto.\r\n[*]In the Tracker URLs section, paste in your personal announce URL.\r\n[*]Unselect \"Start seeding\" if it is available.\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\nDeluge:\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Navigate to File -> Create Torrent (Ctrl + N)\r\n[*]Click either \'File\' for a single file, or \'Folder\' for a folder of multiple files\r\n[*]Browse to the file or folder to include and click \'Open\'\r\n[*]Copy your personal announce URL, then in the Trackers tab, click \'Add\'\r\n[*]In the Options tab, ensure \'Set Private Flag\' is ticked\r\n[*]Click \'Save\', then upload the resulting .torrent file.\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[/spoiler]\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n[b]2. Getting Mediainfo[/b]\r\n[spoiler]To upload, ensure that either MediaInfo is provided.\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Get MediaInfo: https://mediaarea.net/en/MediaInfo\r\n[*]Open the file you want to upload with MediaInfo\r\n[*]Verify that the \"View\" at the top of the MediaInfo window is set to \"Text\"\r\n[*]Select the whole text and copy it into the MediaInfo parser box\r\n[/list][/spoiler]\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n[b]3. Screenshots[/b]\r\n[spoiler]\r\nIn order to comply with the requirement, it is necessary to include a minimum of three screenshots related to your title within the description box.\r\n\r\nThis section will provide a brief overview of how to capture and insert screenshots. If you require more comprehensive information, please refer to the detailed screenshot guide using ruTorrent and imgbox.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n[b]Create screenshots[/b]\r\nThere are multiple tools available for generating screenshots of your title. Here, are some commonly used ones.\r\n\r\n\r\n[list]\r\n[*]VLC media player\r\n[*]ruTorrent (Plugin)\r\n[*]FFMpeg\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\nRegardless of which option you select, it is important to ensure that the screenshots are created with adequate quality and saved in either PNG or TIFF format.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n[b]Image hoster[/b]\r\n<br/>\r\nThe screenshots must be hosted on a website that allows the generation of thumbnails (for example: imgbb or imgbox). If the provider allows you to choose the thumbnail resolution during the upload process, opt for a width of 350px.\r\n\r\nAfter uploading the images, the hosting platform will probably give you BBCodes for image thumbnails. These thumbnails should be added to the description, ensuring that the images shown are around 350px wide. The description should contain BBCode images that are hyperlinked to the full size images on the image hosting platform. The two examples mentioned earlier will generate the appropriate BBCode output for this functionality.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n[b]BBCode example[/b]\r\n<br/>\r\nThe following proper example shows 4 linked thumbnails. (Please be aware that there has been an additional space inserted after the \"[\" in order to display the code in this example.)\r\n\r\n[code][ center]\r\n[ url=https://pixhost.to/show/282/439053120_file-upload-0.png][ img=350]https://img93.pixhost.to/images/282/439053120_file-upload-0.png[/img][/url]\r\n[ url=https://pixhost.to/show/282/439053125_file-upload-0.png][ img=350]https://img93.pixhost.to/images/282/439053125_file-upload-0.png[/img][/url]\r\n[ url=https://pixhost.to/show/282/439053134_file-upload-0.png][ img=350]https://img93.pixhost.to/images/282/439053134_file-upload-0.png[/img][/url]\r\n[ url=https://pixhost.to/show/282/439053139_file-upload-0.png][ img=350]https://img93.pixhost.to/images/282/439053139_file-upload-0.png[/img][/url]\r\n[ /center][/code]\r\n\r\n[/spoiler]\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n[b]4. Naming[/b]\r\n[spoiler]\r\nUNDER CONSTRUCTION<br/>\r\nThe most challenging aspect is coming up with the right name. For now we do not have enough time to come out with one. But You can get the idea from uploaded torrent in this tracker.\r\n[/spoiler]\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n[b]5. What\'s next?[/b]\r\n[spoiler]After submitting, please download the torrent from our website and add it into your client, making sure to direct it to the appropriate folder or file[/spoiler]','2024-06-22 14:17:29','2024-07-18 12:07:26'),(5,'Tracker Codes','Our Tracker Codes/Responses','2024-06-22 14:17:29','2024-06-22 14:17:29'),(6,'Terms Of Use','*All references to \"we\", \"us\" or \"our\" refer to the site owner(s).\n\nWelcome to our website 