INSERT INTO `posts` VALUES (1,'Selamat datang ke Malayabits\r\n\r\nKami nak tahu pasal anda, perkenalkan diri anda dengan \"create\" topik baru dalam forum ni dan dapat 1000 BON points!','2024-06-28 14:27:42','2024-06-28 14:27:42',3,1),(2,'Seperti tajuk thread ni. Upload avatar / profile picture anda. Lepas upload, reply dalam thread ni dan saya akan bagi 3,000 BON Points.','2024-06-28 14:34:28','2024-06-28 14:34:28',6,2),(3,'da upload, ehe','2024-06-28 14:35:20','2024-06-28 14:35:20',28,2),(4,'done jugak','2024-06-28 14:53:36','2024-06-28 14:53:36',62,2),(5,'Done bosskur','2024-06-28 17:20:59','2024-06-28 17:20:59',125,2),(6,'Sudah letak bosku....mau BON please. hehehe','2024-06-28 18:20:10','2024-06-28 18:20:10',142,2),(7,'Selamat lemai geng.\r\n\r\nahmadotomen sini. baru dalam dunia private tracker mau almost a year sudah.\r\n\r\nsalam perkenalan','2024-06-28 18:22:17','2024-06-28 18:22:17',142,3),(8,'udah dong','2024-06-28 18:59:47','2024-06-28 18:59:47',64,2),(9,'Salam perkenalan. BON rewarded','2024-06-28 22:17:35','2024-06-28 22:17:35',3,3),(10,'Uploaded','2024-06-29 00:54:07','2024-06-29 00:54:07',139,2),(11,'Salam All,\r\n\r\nHope this community will grow more and be one of the best tracker!','2024-06-29 02:15:39','2024-06-29 02:15:39',76,4),(12,'W\'salam, welcome Arabics','2024-06-29 03:38:14','2024-06-29 03:38:14',3,4),(13,'Jackett support dah ada geng. Update Jackett to latest version: https://github.com/Jackett/Jackett/releases/tag/v0.22.228','2024-06-29 06:14:27','2024-06-29 06:14:27',3,5),(14,'MalayaBits dah supported by Prowlarr guys!\r\n\r\n[URL=https://imgbox.com/66ouVpZH][IMG]https://images2.imgbox.com/b9/b8/66ouVpZH_o.jpg[/IMG][/URL]','2024-06-29 06:28:25','2024-06-29 06:28:25',6,6),(15,'Uploaded bosskurrr','2024-06-29 06:39:29','2024-06-29 06:39:29',76,2),(16,'uploaded bos','2024-06-29 06:59:49','2024-06-29 06:59:49',15,2),(17,'salam perkenalan dari selangor.\r\n\r\nlama da cari private tracker tuk MY. ada satu tracker tu tak tau apa jadi terkubur dah lama tggu tak up2 balik.\r\nharap tracker kekal sampai bila2.','2024-06-29 07:02:22','2024-06-29 07:02:22',15,7),(18,'Nampak bro berpengalaman dalam private tracker. Harap kita boleh sama2 support MalayaBits','2024-06-29 07:43:02','2024-06-29 07:43:02',3,7),(19,'takde hal bos. mmg plan seeding 24/7 apa torrent yg aku download.','2024-06-29 07:54:24','2024-06-29 07:54:24',15,7),(20,'Halooo saya dah upload profile picture','2024-06-29 13:48:31','2024-06-29 13:48:31',27,2),(21,'Hello, saya sebagai peminat malay movie / series / anime dan k-variety series.','2024-06-29 13:50:59','2024-06-29 13:50:59',27,8),(22,'Terbaik, selamat datang','2024-06-29 14:49:58','2024-06-29 14:49:58',3,8),(23,'ðŸ‘','2024-06-29 16:34:04','2024-06-29 16:34:04',238,2),(24,'done','2024-06-29 16:56:57','2024-06-29 16:56:57',251,2),(25,'done','2024-06-29 18:05:10','2024-06-29 18:05:10',256,2),(26,'Salam kenal semua.\r\n\r\nSaya pengguna TorrentDay untuk beberapa tahun.\r\nSemoga private tracker scene malaysia makin maju!','2024-06-29 18:09:15','2024-06-29 18:09:15',256,9),(27,'Done chief','2024-06-29 18:34:36','2024-06-29 18:34:36',260,2),(28,'Selamat datang','2024-06-29 22:56:53','2024-06-29 22:56:53',3,9),(29,'Halo, salam kenal saya dari Indo tak apa kan join ke PT malaysia?','2024-06-29 23:00:06','2024-06-29 23:00:06',279,10),(30,'done bang','2024-06-29 23:11:36','2024-06-29 23:11:36',279,2),(31,'Salam, you are welcome','2024-06-30 02:16:08','2024-06-30 02:16:08',3,10),(32,'Terbaik Admin.. paduuu','2024-06-30 10:34:57','2024-06-30 10:34:57',319,11),(33,'Selamat datang. Cantik animated avatar. Reply dalam thread 1 lagi bro, dpt additional BON points','2024-06-30 11:06:33','2024-06-30 11:06:33',3,11),(34,'dah,, mantabbb','2024-06-30 11:14:18','2024-06-30 11:14:18',319,2),(35,'Salam gais.\r\n\r\nNice finally dah ada private tracker untuk media Malaysia. Dengar cerita dulu macam pernah ada tapi dah terkubur.\r\n\r\nAku ada movies yang takde kat dalam sini, mungkin lepas ni aku upload. Tak pernah lagi try uploading kat mana2 tracker, tapi insyaallah aku cuba yang terbaik.\r\n\r\nApa-apapun, server aku sedia berkhidmat untuk seeding 24/7','2024-06-30 13:17:15','2024-06-30 13:17:15',293,12),(36,'Saya sudah upload','2024-06-30 15:39:41','2024-06-30 15:39:41',328,2),(37,'Jom share dalam ni bro. Mana2 tak clear pasal upload on naming structure etc, bleh tanya dalam chat. Sedia membantu.\r\n\r\nCantekk perma-seed!','2024-06-30 22:56:14','2024-06-30 22:56:14',3,12),(38,'Salam, semoga pt ni kekal bertahun2','2024-07-01 00:02:04','2024-07-01 00:02:30',299,13),(39,'done','2024-07-01 00:03:01','2024-07-01 00:03:01',299,2),(40,'ogei','2024-07-01 00:39:22','2024-07-01 00:39:22',293,2),(41,'Selamat datang','2024-07-01 03:15:28','2024-07-01 03:15:28',3,13),(43,'terbaik bosku...','2024-07-02 18:27:53','2024-07-02 18:27:53',142,5),(44,'done :)','2024-07-06 10:04:12','2024-07-06 10:04:12',236,2),(45,'Ada banyak cerita Malaysia ni tak ada TMDB id. Kalau nak upload dalam tracker ni, wajib ada TMDB.\r\n\r\nSesiapa yang ada kelapangan masa, boleh bantu untuk create TMDB id untuk movie/series Malaysia. Kami akan bagi BON sebanyak 5K untuk setiap TMDB creation.\r\n\r\nTips: Copy je dari IMDB atau scrapper yang seangkatan.','2024-07-07 01:47:03','2024-07-07 01:47:03',6,14),(46,'Saya perlukan bantuan create TMDB untuk movie ni: Hud (2022)\r\n\r\nBoleh refer sini: https://www.myinfotaip.com/2022/04/telefilem-hud.html','2024-07-07 01:48:27','2024-07-07 01:48:27',6,14),(47,'ada guide tak untuk tak kena mark abuse? risau salah setup','2024-07-09 10:54:20','2024-07-09 10:54:20',483,6),(48,'[quote=@aqsede94]ada guide tak untuk tak kena mark abuse? risau salah setup[/quote] \r\n\r\nPernah guna prowlarr la kan sebelum ni. Ok je, tak hit limit pun. Nak guna untuk cross seeding ker apa?','2024-07-09 11:32:27','2024-07-09 11:32:27',3,6),(49,'Ya, tapi Nyaa selalu kena disable, lebih limit la kot. Cross seeding tu tak sure la pulak apa. Tapi prowlarr pakai untuk plex automation','2024-07-09 13:16:26','2024-07-09 13:16:26',483,6),(50,'RSS 10 minute min interval ke bos?','2024-07-09 13:36:49','2024-07-09 13:36:49',142,6),(51,'Rate limit API = 5x per minute per IP\r\nRate limit announce = 2000x per minute per IP\r\nRate limit RSS = 2x per minute per IP','2024-07-09 23:20:37','2024-07-09 23:20:37',3,6),(52,'Done','2024-07-10 13:31:29','2024-07-10 13:31:29',483,2),(53,'Hellu bosku-bosku sekalian.\r\n\r\nAdalah sangat baik jikalau uploader-uploader sekalian bagi sedikit tunjuk ajar tata-cara untuk upload torrent dlm private trackers, especially dalam malayabits ni.\r\n\r\nSaya sudah setahun lebih join private tracker world, teringin nak upload utk contribute tp masih teragak2 dgn rules/cara/teknik yang betul.','2024-07-10 16:09:02','2024-07-10 16:09:02',142,15),(54,'Hujung minggu ni kami cuba update Upload Rules &amp; How.','2024-07-10 19:55:04','2024-07-10 19:55:04',3,15),(55,'Cerita Pulau ni memang dah lesap ke selepas wayang?\r\nTak jumpa dalam mana-mana streaming dah public tracker\r\n\r\nIMDB: https://www.imdb.com/title/tt26249116/','2024-07-11 03:36:28','2024-07-11 03:36:28',483,16),(56,'https://malayabits.cc/torrents/226\r\n\r\nBoleh download sini','2024-07-11 03:54:09','2024-07-11 03:54:09',3,16),(57,'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1315497-hud','2024-07-11 04:01:40','2024-07-11 04:01:40',483,14),(58,'alamak, mcm mana boleh tak jumpa sblum ni haha','2024-07-11 04:04:06','2024-07-11 04:04:06',483,16),(59,'[quote=@aqsede94]https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1315497-hud[/quote]\r\n\r\nTerbaik. BON given.','2024-07-11 04:35:13','2024-07-11 04:35:13',3,14),(60,'ok dah upload boss ðŸ¤©ðŸ¤©','2024-07-13 03:43:43','2024-07-13 03:43:43',512,2),(61,'salam kenal semua. \r\nsaya hanyalah seorang insan yang suka mendownload torrent. \r\nsaya support cerita melayu. \r\nharap tracker ni bertahan lama. \r\ntak sangka ada juga admin guna web unit3d ni. \r\ningatkan haritu nak bangunkan sendiri\r\n. tapi malas la. busy kerja nnt tak terjaga. \r\nharap admin reqruit ramai uploader. \r\nall the best admin. mantapppppp ðŸ˜˜ðŸ˜˜','2024-07-13 03:49:27','2024-07-13 03:49:27',512,17),(62,'Boleh refer sini guide macam mana nak create torrent &amp; upload dalam tracker ni. Tak comprehensive tapi boleh la bagi idea macam mana sedikit sebanyak.\r\n\r\nhttps://malayabits.cc/pages/4\r\n\r\nKalau ada pertanyaan lanjut, tanya je dalam chat.','2024-07-13 04:23:49','2024-07-13 04:23:49',3,15),(63,'Selamat datang.\r\n\r\nSaya admin takde expert jugak dan masa pun nak kata banyak pun tak juga. Tapi sebab minat, kita cuba.\r\nHarap bro pun boleh sama2 bangunkan tracker ni. Terima kasih.','2024-07-13 04:28:39','2024-07-13 04:28:39',3,17),(64,'InshaAllah kita bantu mana yang boleh....','2024-07-13 04:43:55','2024-07-13 04:43:55',512,17),(65,'Done boss','2024-07-14 05:37:55','2024-07-14 05:37:55',198,2),(66,'Sadly, my command of Malay is only good enough for basic directions, to say excuse me, sorry, order food, and find the bathroom, so I hope you\'ll indulge me using English instead.\r\nI ended up here from the the opensignups subreddit.  I\'m very excited to discover this tracker, as Malaysian movies are really hard to find where I live.  I\'ve uploaded some of my existing collection that are not yet on this site, and will share more as I find them.','2024-07-14 21:38:56','2024-07-14 21:38:56',515,18),(67,'Welcome to MalayaBits, hiroshi.\r\n\r\nAcceptable language here would be Malay &amp; English, no worries. I eny you that you kept all those P Ramlee\'s movies.','2024-07-14 21:54:17','2024-07-14 21:54:17',3,18),(68,'where you from dude?','2024-07-15 01:38:58','2024-07-15 01:38:58',512,18),(69,'Hey there!  I\'m based down in NZ.  Got family up in Port Klang though.','2024-07-15 21:49:03','2024-07-15 21:49:03',515,18),(70,'[quote=@hiroshi]Hey there!  I\'m based down in NZ.  Got family up in Port Klang though.[/quote]\r\n\r\nJauh merantau bang ? kerja sana ea ? ke study ?','2024-07-16 02:18:33','2024-07-16 02:18:33',512,18),(71,'nah, born in NZ, my Klang family is through marriage :)  But we get back over there whenever we can.  Eat as much food as possible, and buy as much Ikan Bilis stock, Maggie Mee and Twisties as we can fit in our luggage.','2024-07-16 05:17:22','2024-07-16 05:17:22',515,18),(72,'Uploadrr Upload Assistant\r\nhttps://github.com/mesoller/Uploadrr\r\nA simple tool to take the work out of uploading.\r\n\r\nYou need to know basic Python knowledge in order to use this script.\r\n\r\nWhat It Does:\r\nGenerates and Parses MediaInfo/BDInfo.\r\nGenerates and Uploads screenshots.\r\nObtains TMDb/IMDb/TVDB/MAL identifiers.\r\nGenerates custom .torrents without useless top level folders/nfos.\r\nGenerates proper name for your upload using Mediainfo/BDInfo and TMDb/IMDb\r\nChecks for existing releases\r\nUploads via API or Generates an archive with all the required info ready for you to copy/paste into the upload form\r\nAdds to your client with fast resume, seeding instantly (rtorrent/qbittorrent/deluge/watch folder)\r\nUses srrdb to fix scene filenames\r\nConverts absolute to season episode numbering for Anime\r\nCan set default overrides based on group e.g.(SubsPlease defaults to WEB-DL instead of the default BluRay Encode)\r\nCan upload to multiple trackers at once\r\nCurrently works with .mkv/.mp4/Blu-rays/DVDs/HD-DVDs\r\nAll with minimal input (all arguments are optional)\r\n\r\nCopy \'example-config.py\' from /data/backup/ directory to your /data/ directory. And rename the file as \'config.py\'.\r\nUpdate the information in config.py accordingly.\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n[code]python upload.py /path/to/files[/code]\r\n[code]python upload.py --help[/code]\r\n\r\nApa-apa soalan. Boleh drop soalan dalam thread ni.','2024-07-16 14:08:25','2024-07-16 14:08:25',3,19),(73,'In case it\'s helpful, I have written a few paragraphs that could be added to the guide:\r\nCreating a torrent file\r\n  Deluge\r\n[quote]deluge:\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Navigate to File -&gt; Create Torrent (Ctrl + N)\r\n[*]Click either \'File\' for a single file, or \'Folder\' for a folder of multiple files\r\n[*]Browse to the file or folder to include and click \'Open\'\r\n[*]Copy your personal announce URL, then in the Trackers tab, click \'Add\'\r\n[*]In the Options tab, ensure \'Set Private Flag\' is ticked\r\n[*]Click \'Save\', then upload the resulting .torrent file.\r\n[/list]\r\n[/quote]\r\n\r\n\r\nScreenshots\r\n  ffmpeg on the command line:\r\n[quote]You can use ffmpeg on the commandline to quickly generate screenshots.  Make sure it is installed (apt install ffmpeg, or yum install ffmpeg).\r\nThen use -ss to select the timestamp to take the screenshot from:\r\neg\r\n[code]ffmpeg -ss 00:00:30 -i musang\\ berjanggut\\ 1959\\ sdtvrip\\ xvid.avi -frames:v 1 -q:v 2 screenshot-titles.jpg[/code]\r\nTakes a screenshot from 30 seconds into the movie, and names it \'screenshot-titles.jpg\'[/quote]','2024-07-17 21:59:10','2024-07-17 21:59:10',515,15),(74,'Assalamu\'alaikum &amp; Salam Sejahtera.\r\n\r\nTerima kasih. redirected here from Kaizoku999\'s pm in another private tracker. I then googled the tracker name and saw a reddit post in it.\r\nTry to register using Yahoo! Mail but no activation email received. Until now.\r\n\r\nRetry using Gmail and here I am...','2024-07-18 10:01:46','2024-07-18 10:01:46',518,20),(75,'Hi teku, selamat datang. Yahoo and Outlook famous for not compatible with this tracker script.','2024-07-18 12:04:52','2024-07-18 12:04:52',3,20),(76,'@hiroshi Tq. Added your contribution in Upload Guide','2024-07-18 12:08:16','2024-07-18 12:08:16',3,15),(77,'uploaded','2024-07-18 14:02:36','2024-07-18 14:02:36',518,2),(78,'Done!','2024-07-20 22:13:24','2024-07-20 22:13:24',555,2),(79,'[b]MalayaBits Users and Uploaders: What Do They Know? Do They Know Things?? Let\'s Find Out![/b]\r\n\r\nI love to read reviews before downloading something, so I\'d love to see reviews right here on this tracker too. To help get the ball rolling, I\'m offering BON as bounty.\r\n\r\nTo receive the bounty, you must do the following:\r\n\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Leave a ~1-2 paragraph review in the comments of an upload\r\n[*]Paste a link in this forum thread\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\nThat\'s it! :)\r\n\r\nFeel free to review/critique both the content and the technical details of the upload itself. I won\'t enforce any hard limits on the length of a review, but please do write more than 2 sentences. (and actually watch the content, of course, please)','2024-07-27 11:21:39','2024-07-27 11:21:39',3,21),(80,'[b]Disclaimer[/b]\r\n1. Tutorial ini untuk back up VCD hak milik anda sahaja.\r\n\r\n[b]Prerequisite[/b]\r\n1. Boleh menggunakan command line/terminal/powershell dengan baik\r\n2. Program FFMPEG telah diinstall\r\n3. Program Avidemux telah diinstall\r\n\r\n[b]Pengenalan[/b][list]\r\n[*]VCD pernah menjadi format yang popular di Asia Tenggara dan memandangkan Malaysia menggunakan sistem PAL, VCD di Malaysia selalunya menggunakan resolusi PAL (352Ã—288) pixel.\r\n[*]Oleh sebab ada VCD yang mencecah usia lebih 30 tahun, dan sesetengah filem/drama Malaysia hanya dijual dalam bentuk VCD, maka sebaiknya VCD ini diselamatkan dari disc rot.\r\n[/list]\r\n[quote]Penting: Tapi kena fahami juga, hard disk failure boleh berlaku, dan kita haruslah mempuyai \"redundant plan\" (backup kepada backup). Contohnya seperti RAID ataupun simpan di mega, google drive, etc. Kesimpulannya, backup anda harus mempunyai 2-3 salinan di tempat yang berbeza[/quote]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Keperluan hardware[/b]\r\n1. Desktop/laptop yang mempunyai DVD/CD drive\r\n2. Kalau tak ada, USB DVD/CD drive pun boleh. Ada dijual di shopee. Pilih yang jenis USB 2.0 pun dah memadai. \r\n\r\n[quote]Penting: Dari pengalaman saya, kadang-kadang USB DVD/CD drive ni cerewet untuk baca scratched disc. Usahakan untuk cari DVD/CD drive yang second hand tapi masih berfungsi dan branded contoh macam Sony, Liteon etc. Laptop lama yang masih mempunyai combo DVD/CD drive pun boleh digunakan[/quote]\r\n\r\n[b]Keperluan software[/b]\r\n1. Ffmpeg\r\n2. Avidemux\r\n\r\n[b]Proses backup (hanya copy &amp; paste)[/b]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Cara untuk backup sangat mudah kerana kebanyakan VCD di Malaysia tidak mempunyai copy protection. Hanya copy &amp; paste seluruh folder ke hard disk anda. Sila beri penekanan dalam aspek \"naming convention\"  dan juga \"folder structure\" \r\n[*]Contoh seperti di bawah, VCD filem Raja Bersiong versi 1963, saya menyusun foldernya sebagai CD1, CD2, dll. Dalam VCD, content video dsimpan sebagai file .dat dalam folder MPEGAV\r\n\r\n[url=https://ibb.co/sqnwdyy][img]https://i.ibb.co/6FzP7gg/vcd2.png[/img][/url]\r\n[url=https://ibb.co/GQ5Gbff][img]https://i.ibb.co/QvKh177/vcd1.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n[*]Namun kita mesti terima kenyataan, tak semua VCD dapat diselamatkan, sesetengahnya akan mempunyai digital glitch. Kadang-kadang anda juga perlu membuat visual inspection untuk hal ini.\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Cara menonton[/b]\r\nCara menonton VCD sangat mudah. Hanya play .dat file tersebut di player favourite anda seperti VLC atau MPC, tetapi ia sedikit leceh dan lebih baik kita \"remux\" kan ia ke container .mkv.\r\n\r\n[b]Proses remux[/b]\r\n[quote]Penting: Proses remux juga boleh dilakukan direct dari CD drive, tetapi lebih baik jika kita copy dat file ke hard disk terlebih dahulu \r\n[/quote]\r\n[quote]Penting: Codec MPEG1 VCD tak streaming friendly, tak optimize untuk streaming. Jika anda pengguna plex, emby atau jellyfin, server anda akan bekerja lebih keras untuk CPU/GPU transcoding. Consider using VLC/MPC or kodi.\r\n[/quote]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]File .dat sebenarnya ialah file container .mpg (menyimpan format MPEG video/audio) yang telah diubah nama. Di sini kita akan membuat proses remux dan mengubahnya ke container .mkv.\r\n\r\n[*]Konsepnya, kita demux mpg file tersebut dan remux ia ke mkv file. (Anggaplah seperti cuma ganti baju) \r\n\r\n[*]\"Remux\" di sini bermaksud  membuat 1:1 exact copy untuk file video dan audio sahaja, tak ada re-encoding atau transcoding. Secara teorinya tidak ada \"quality loss\" berlaku. Kalau dalam DVD/Bluray, cuma extract video, audio, multiple audio (jika ada), commentary, dan subtitle track sahaja. Content extras ditinggalkan. Tapi untuk kali ini, kita fokus ke VCD sahaja.\r\n\r\n[*]Ada banyak cara untuk buat remux ikut kebiasaan masing-masing, saya tunjukkan dua cara.\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\nCara 1: Guna FFMPEG\r\nDalam contoh ini, saya gunakan powershell\r\n\r\n1. Sila run command ini di folder yang berkaitan. Sila rujuk screenshot\r\n[code]ffmpeg -avoid_negative_ts 1 -fflags +genpts -i .\\MUSIC01.DAT -vcodec copy -acodec copy output-cd1.mkv[/code]\r\n\r\n[url=https://ibb.co/3p5M4t3][img]https://i.ibb.co/JvWymX1/vcd3.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n2. Selepas itu, pindah ke folder CD2 dan run command yang sama. Anda akan mempunyai 2 file mkv bernama output-cd1.mkv dan output-cd2.mkv\r\n\r\n3. Buka program avidemux dan cantumkan kedua file ini. Open output-cd1.mkv terlebih dahulu. Kemudian append video kedua. Sila rujuk screenshot\r\n\r\n[url=https://ibb.co/zZsqmtx][img]https://i.ibb.co/m4JfRPT/vcd4.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n4. Pastikan juga video output &amp; audio ouput di set kepada \"copy\" seperti screenshot di bawah\r\n\r\n[url=https://ibb.co/PCr3KfL][img]https://i.ibb.co/kcGkjW7/vcd5.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n5. Pergi ke Audio &gt; Select tracks dan set metadata language ke Malay seperti screenshot di bawah. Ubah mengikut bahasa yang digunakan dalam VCD\r\n\r\n[url=https://ibb.co/RHVyd6v][img]https://i.ibb.co/C0T2D91/vcd6.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n6. Klik file &gt; save.\r\n\r\n\r\nCara 2: Guna Avidemux direct\r\n1. Open kedua-dua dat file di avidemux. Guna option append untuk file  yang kedua.\r\n\r\n2. Ulang step 4, 5, 6 seperti di atas\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Hasil[/b]\r\nHasilnya anda akan mendapat sebuah file full movie dalam bentuk mkv. Silalah mirror ke mana-mana tracker, website DDL ataupun archive.org untuk simpanan.','2024-07-28 09:05:40','2024-07-28 09:14:43',395,22),(81,'[b]Disclaimer[/b]\r\n1. Tutorial ini hanya untuk back up DVD hak milik anda sahaja.\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Pengenalan[/b]\r\nTak dinafikan, dengan wujudnya servis streaming, WEB-DL &amp; WEBRip menjadi pilihan utama, dan DVD semakin dilupakan. Iklim di Malaysia yang panas &amp; lembap (hot &amp; humid) juga boleh menyumbang kepada kerosakan media fizikal jika tidak dijaga dengan baik.\r\n\r\nKonsepnya ialah kita nak backup DVD kita sementara disc masih boleh read, sebelum berhabuk, scratch, atau rosak (disc rot). Kita cuba mengarkib secara peribadi.\r\n\r\n[quote]Penting: Tapi kena fahami juga, hard disk failure boleh berlaku, dan kita haruslah mempuyai \"redundant plan\" (backup kepada backup). Contohnya seperti RAID ataupun simpan di mega, google drive, etc. Kesimpulannya, backup anda harus mempunyai 2-3 salinan di tempat yang berbeza[/quote]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Keperluan hardware[/b]\r\n1. PC / laptop yang mempunyai DVD drive\r\n2. Kalau tak ada, USB DVD drive pun boleh didapati di shopee. Pilih yang jenis USB 2.0 pun dah memadai.\r\n\r\n[quote]Penting: Dari pengalaman saya, kadang-kadang USB DVD/CD drive ni cerewet untuk baca scratched disc. Usahakan untuk cari DVD/CD drive yang second hand tapi masih berfungsi dan branded contoh macam Sony, Liteon etc. Laptop lama yang masih mempunyai combo DVD/CD drive pun boleh digunakan[/quote]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Keperluan software[/b]\r\n1. DVD Decrypter\r\nvideohelp.com/software/DVD-Decrypter\r\n2. RipIt4Me\r\nvideohelp.com/software/RipIt4Me\r\n\r\n[b]Installation &amp; Configuration[/b]\r\n1. Install DVD Decrypter dan ingatlah installation pathnya, selalunya di program files\r\n\r\n[url=https://imgbb.com/][img]https://i.ibb.co/4VcbddQ/1.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n2. Kemudian, unzip RipIt4Me\r\n3. Kita perlu configure kedua-duanya. Mulakan dengan RipIt4Me dulu.\r\n4. Buka program RipIt4Me\r\n5. Click Logs/Settings &gt; Preferences\r\n6. Sila ikut settings seperti screenshot di bawah\r\n\r\n\r\n[url=https://imgbb.com/][img]https://i.ibb.co/CJRJxMm/2.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n\r\n[*] Base path for target rips: Sila pilih lokasi folder untuk save\r\n[*] Path to Decrypter: Silih pilih lokasi install DVD Decrypter seperti di no.1\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n9. Click OK dan close program RipIt4Me\r\n10. Kemudian, buka program DVD Decrypter\r\n11. Pergi ke Tools &gt; Settings &gt;IFO Mode\r\n12. Adjust settings di IFO Mode seperti screenshot di bawah.\r\n\r\n\r\n[url=https://imgbb.com/][img]https://i.ibb.co/wJjFqv0/3.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n\r\n13. Klik OK dan close DVD Decrypter. Kita dah ready untuk proses ripping\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Proses Ripping[/b]\r\n1. Masukkan DVD anda ke DVD drive.\r\n2. Buka program RipIt4Me.\r\n3. Klik \"1-Click Mode\".\r\n4. RipIt4Me akan mula scan DVD anda. Pastikan anda pilih settings seperti screenshot di bawah\r\n\r\n[url=https://imgbb.com/][img]https://i.ibb.co/X4Xc7vv/4.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n\r\n5. \"Full DVD\" dipilih\r\n6. 3 checkboxes di bawah \"Cleanup VOBs settings\" juga dipilih\r\n7. Anda bolehlah ubah \"Target directory for DVD filesâ€ untuk ubah lokasi save folder ke lokasi yang lebih sesuai\r\n8. Klik \"Next\" dan RipIt4Me akan mulakan proses ripping. (Atau lebih tepatnya, kombinasi kedua-dua program akan memulakan rip process)\r\n\r\n\r\n[url=https://imgbb.com/][img]https://i.ibb.co/3zZXsFV/5.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n\r\n9. Proses akan bergantung dengan keadaan DVD anda. Selalunya dalam 30 minit. Tapi kalau keadaan DVD kurang baik, mungkin mengambil masa lebih lama. Kalau proses stuck, itu tandanya DVD tak dapat diselamatkan dan proses ripping tak berjaya.\r\n10. Jika terdapat â€œUnable to patch DVD Decrypterâ€ error ataupun error tentang PSL files, close kedua-dua program dan run RipIt4Me â€œas an administrator.â€\r\n\r\n11. Setelah siap, RipIt4Me akan clean up hasilnya. Anda akan nampak mesej â€œVOB Cleanup Doneâ€ di log RipIt4Me. Sepatutnya anda akan mempunyai sebuah folder bernama \"VIDEO_TS\" yang mengandungi files unencrypted VOB dan IFO.\r\n12. Tapi dalam kes saya, ada beberapa log files dan folder yang tertinggal. Anda bolehlah delete benda tersebut seperti yang ditanda pada screenshot di bawah.\r\n13. Pastikan yang tinggal cuma IFO, VOB, dan BUP files\r\n\r\n\r\n[url=https://imgbb.com/][img]https://i.ibb.co/1frmdC3/6.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Playback[/b]\r\n1. Cara termudah untuk menonton backup DVD adalah dengan menggunakan VLC player\r\n2. Drag and drop folder \"VIDEO_TS\" ke VLC player\r\n3. Ataupun \"right click\" folder \"VIDEO_TS\" &gt; \"Play with VLC media player\"\r\n4. Hasilnya\r\n\r\n\r\n[url=https://ibb.co/dD7f9Ct][img]https://i.ibb.co/x632v9Y/7.png[/img][/url]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]Penutup[/b]\r\nJika anda telah baca sampai sini, tahniah diucapkan. Anda boleh menjadi ripper untuk koleksi DVD anda. Folder \"VIDEO_TS\" ini boleh gunakan sebagai source untuk encoding DVDRip pada masa akan datang. Kita boleh gunakan sama ada program handbrake, staxrip, ataupun script avisynth+x264 simple launcher. Malah, kita boleh apply beberapa filter seperti debanding, anti-aliasing untuk perbaiki kualiti DVDRip kita.','2024-07-28 10:04:04','2024-07-28 10:04:04',395,23),(83,'Salam semua. Agak terkejut ada private tracker Malaysia dengan openreg. Baru berjinak-jinak dengan private tracker. Saya tak ada seedbox tapi server kat rumah memang sentiasa on dan seeding.  Harap boleh berbaik-baik dengan semua kat sini','2024-09-05 04:22:16','2024-09-05 04:22:16',666,25),(84,'asyiappp bos','2024-09-05 05:10:06','2024-09-05 05:10:06',666,2),(85,'Selamat datang, kami baru je bukak 3 bulan lepas. Nak ramai lagi join baru kita tutup openreg. Cantek dh tu ada server kat rumah, kita punya HnR mudah je for a start ni, seed at least 24 hours.','2024-09-05 05:53:48','2024-09-05 05:53:48',6,25),(86,'Encoder sejati ni, siap follow bila ada tanyangan','2024-09-05 05:55:50','2024-09-05 05:55:50',6,24),(87,'Sudah diperolehi.','2024-09-11 14:35:59','2024-09-11 16:29:32',28,24),(88,'Mantap bos. Terima kasih. Baru sedut siri Melayu yang \"Best of\". Sekarang ni tengah mencari Upin Ipin full series HD yang proper punya. Susah betul nak cari.','2024-09-16 07:52:05','2024-09-16 07:52:05',666,25),(89,'Kalau ada yang season awal-awal pun cantik dah. Ke memang tak pernah lagi orang kita rip dari Netflix?','2024-09-16 07:54:29','2024-09-16 07:54:29',666,26),(90,'Konsep private server kebiasaannya content yang dari platform berbayar. Saya nampak semua episode ada je readily available dlm youtube sebab tu series upin &amp; ipin  tak pernah orang rip atau masuk netflix kot, melainkan movie la. \r\n\r\nhttps://youtube.com/@lescopaque\r\n\r\nBoleh je nak rip tapi rasanya orang lagi selesa stream directly dari youtube rasanya.','2024-09-16 09:01:29','2024-09-16 09:01:29',6,26),(91,'Saya perlukan bantuan untuk create TMDB entri untuk series Bawah Payung Awan. Info seperti di bawah:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.myinfotaip.com/2024/05/bawah-payung-awan.html','2024-09-16 12:21:14','2024-09-16 12:21:14',3,14),(92,'Tak semua episode ada dalam channel LesCopaque tu. Dia banyak trailer dengan teaser je. Semua sekerat-sekerat. Tak proper. Macam nak try je guna streamfab tapi takde masa dan ongkos pulaaa. Tu tanya kot ada yang dah rip ke. Archival purpose pun okay gak sebab Netflix jenis sampai satu masa, dia keluarkan siri tu. Tak dapek la nak tengok lagi full semuanya.','2024-09-16 16:11:00','2024-09-16 16:11:00',666,26),(93,'[quote=@HarimauMalaya]Saya perlukan bantuan untuk create TMDB entri untuk series Bawah Payung Awan. Info seperti di bawah:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.myinfotaip.com/2024/05/bawah-payung-awan.html[/quote]\r\n\r\n[url]https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/271651-bawah-payung-awan[/url]\r\n\r\nDone bro','2024-09-16 17:09:51','2024-09-16 17:09:51',666,14),(94,'@xarmx terima kasih, BON sent','2024-09-17 01:23:30','2024-09-17 01:23:30',6,14),(95,'v8.2.0-0 | Update: 2024/09/20\r\n\r\nUNIT3D Changes:\r\n\r\n(Revert) Group histories and uploads by month by @Roardom in #3806\r\n(Update) Clean up nerd bot messages by @Roardom in #3800\r\n(Fix) Groups stats advance calculations for date values by @Obi-Wana in #3801\r\n(Fix) Prevent duplicated notifications by @Obi-Wana in #3802\r\n(Fix) Meta Data Links by @arthurmelton in #3807\r\n(Add) Custom top 10 interval by @Roardom in #3809\r\n(Fix) Unit3dAnnounce Service by @HDVinnie in #3811\r\n(Update) Commands by @HDVinnie in #3788\r\n(Add) Auto submit 2fa code when 6 digits are entered by @Roardom in #3813\r\n(Add) Request #3692 by @HDVinnie in #3814\r\n(Fix) Connectable status on user actives page by @Roardom in #3816\r\n(Fix) Wrong variable used in top 10 custom interval cache by @Roardom in #3820\r\n(Fix) Group requirements seedtimes by @Obi-Wana in #3821\r\n(Fix) Catch error when external tracker is offline by @Roardom in #3822\r\n(Fix) Random media caching when nothing to cache by @Roardom in #3828\r\n(Fix) Use query builder instead of eloquent by @Roardom in #3830\r\n(Fix) Type of fillable model attribute by @Roardom in #3827\r\n(Update) Chunk users in autogroup command by @Roardom in #3797\r\n(Refactor) String Helpers by @Roardom in #3833\r\n(Update) Redesign footer by @Roardom in #3835\r\n(Fix) Use light-themed navbar on light theme by @Roardom in #3836\r\n(Fix) Provide fallback font for revel stylesheet by @Roardom in #3837\r\n(Update) Improve key-value styles by @Roardom in #3838\r\n(Fix) Escaping out of quick search by @Roardom in #3839\r\n(Fix) Img alt tags by @Roardom in #3841\r\n(Fix) Various playlist styles by @Roardom in #3842\r\n(Fix) Exclude private playlists from torrent search by @Roardom in #3843\r\n(Update) timeElapsed now returns used values only by @ThyThal in #3846\r\n(Fix) Revel stylesheet touchups by @Roardom in #3845\r\n(Add) Livewire playlist search by @Roardom in #3844\r\n(Fix) Bug #3812 by @HDVinnie in #3848\r\n(Fix) Footer Link by @HDVinnie in #3849\r\n(Fix) genres for games and collection array error by @LostRager in #3853\r\n(Update) Remove user avatar from playlist card by @Roardom in #3852\r\n(Update) Use PHP strict types for all files by @Roardom in #3855\r\n(Update) Improve hierarchy files by @Roardom in #3856\r\n(Fix) Allow 0000000, etc. for id entry by @Roardom in #3857\r\n(Update) Copy announce url to clipboard on click by @Roardom in #3858\r\n(Fix) Broken bookmarks button by @Roardom in #3859\r\n(Fix) Quicksearch hardcoded category ids by @Roardom in #3860\r\n(Fix) Refundable torrents by @Roardom in #3861\r\n(Fix) User bon earning calculation by @Roardom in #3862\r\n(Refactor) Wishlist and add movie/tv subscriptions by @Roardom in #3863\r\n(Add) Display peer visibility on external torrent page by @Roardom in #3865\r\n(Fix) Only include visible peers when sending to external tracker by @Roardom in #3866\r\n(Fix) Encode settings overflowing out of torrent code box by @Roardom in #3867\r\n(Fix) Tagging users in posts by @Roardom in #3868\r\n(Add) Updated timestamp to user notes panel by @Roardom in #3869\r\n(Update) Torrent group monthly season pack naming by @Roardom in #3870\r\n(Remove) Unused columns on users table by @Roardom in #3871\r\n(Update) Normalize user settings by @Roardom in #3872\r\n(Update) Use eager loading for comment children existence by @Roardom in #3873\r\n(Fix) Types on torrent meta trait by @Roardom in #3875\r\n(Fix) Force redirect /index.php/ requests by @Roardom in #3877\r\n(Update) Reduce queries on playlist show by @Roardom in #3874\r\n(Fix) Strict types by @Roardom in #3878\r\n(Fix) Download check key value styles by @Roardom in #3879\r\n(Fix) Setting meta attribute on torrent meta trait by @Roardom in #3880\r\n(Update) Remove duplicate query in top nav by @Roardom in #3881\r\n(Fix) Various wishlist issues by @Roardom in #3882\r\n(Fix) Unexpected incrementEach effects by @Roardom in #3883\r\n(Add) Validate max textarea length by @Obi-Wana in #3823\r\n(Refactor) Clean up user settings controllers by @Roardom in #3885\r\n(Fix) Select default user settings when none exists by @Roardom in #3886\r\n(Update) Show error when external tracker returns error by @Roardom in #3887\r\n(Fix) Adding blacklisted clients to external tracker by @Roardom in #3888\r\n(U