INSERT INTO `requests` VALUES (1,'Khunsa',2,249110,249110,249110,0,'0','Ada dalam Sooka, tapi tak mampu nak rip sendiri banyak episod lol.\r\n\r\nBukak request untuk nak bagi BON.',3,100000.00,1,1,0,'2024-07-01 12:45:13','2024-07-23 23:25:29',6,366,'2024-07-23 23:25:09',1,3,'2024-07-23 23:25:29',4,3),(2,'Telefilem Mandi Mayat',2,0,0,1036595,0,'0','[center]\r\n\r\n\r\n[img=350]https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjYEbYXDqzJzas2AG3uHY7-HNDbKMtCRXbLffL5eSvFgPEUhf8BIhS3ekNiXQkewpftdqF7ivTdvWVUHB97Icy-zFzcP-bXLgeG0EJq3GokgvmE5uNQnefddBKtTYVj5LwkS1HfkpQlnejAWdMxqg16suc-x6DoFjxZAAVqJxGetr6Af9qXRNIiBCdXIA/s16000/Mandi%20Mayat.jpg[/img]\r\n\r\n[/center]\r\n\r\n\r\nTelefilem seram, Mandi Mayat lakonan Zul Ariffin dan Khatijah Tan bakal bersiaran di slot Citra Exclusive, pada Sabtu, 8 Oktober 2022, jam 10:00 malam di Astro Citra.\r\n\r\nMandi Mayat\r\nWaktu Siaran: Sabtu, 8 Oktober 2022, 10:00 malam\r\nRangkaian: Astro Citra slot Citra Exclusive\r\nIdea Asal: Syawal Azrai\r\nPenulis Skrip: Srikandi Emma &amp; Seri Dewi\r\nPengarah: Azmir Affandi\r\nProduksi: Efficent Action Sdn Bhd\r\nPelakon: Zul Ariffin, Khatijah Tan, Syefikk, Che Nurul Ain Syahira, Khairul Annuar Hj Jantan\r\n\r\n[b]Sinopsis Mandi Mayat[/b]\r\nSyawal bekerja sebagai pengurus jenazah di rumah mayat Hospital. Dia yang baru sahaja bekerja mula mendapat mayat dari pelbagai latar dan sebab kematian mula mengalami pengalaman aneh apabila dia melanggar petua orang tua tentang pengurusan jenazah dari ibunya yang juga merupakan seorang pemandi jenazah sehinggalah dia akhirnya terkena badi mayat.\r\n\r\n\r\nAssalamualaikum.\r\nSaya nak request telefilem ni.\r\nMaaf tak dapat nak bg bon banyak. Kita baru mula mula nak kumpul point ni.\r\nSemoga ada yang upload. Harap dapat version 720p atau 1080p.',512,500.00,1,NULL,0,'2024-07-16 13:15:51','2024-07-16 14:36:48',28,285,'2024-07-16 13:54:11',0,512,'2024-07-16 14:36:48',6,3),(3,'Rehan - Rehan (1980)',3,0,0,0,0,'0','MP3 or Flac\r\n\r\nmore info:  https://www.discogs.com/release/13779915-Rehan-Rehan',555,100.00,1,NULL,0,'2024-07-21 10:01:42','2024-07-21 10:01:42',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,8,10),(4,'Noorkumalasari - Jangan Kau Kembali (1981)',3,0,0,0,0,'0','Mp3 or Flac\r\n\r\nmore info: https://www.discogs.com/release/12530606-Noor-Jangan-Kau-Kembali',555,100.00,1,NULL,0,'2024-07-21 10:04:34','2024-07-21 10:04:34',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,8,10),(5,'I.D',2,31261705,447410,248117,0,'0','When the creator of an app was unfairly fired and no longer able to meet his \"soulmate\", he had decided to confront his fear that leads to the country\'s biggest scammer attack ever known in history.',483,1000.00,1,NULL,0,'2024-07-26 04:14:28','2024-07-26 16:18:15',3,377,'2024-07-26 13:35:58',1,483,'2024-07-26 16:18:15',5,4),(6,'Penunggu Gunung Raya (2010)',2,5109280,131415,61005,44408,'0','Kalau remux takde, type lain pun boleh asalkan minimum resolution 720p. Btw, TMDB ID je ada, id lain semua salah. Thanks\r\n\r\n\r\nOverview\r\n\r\nGunung Raya is a drama series set in a village called Gunung Raya. This horror mystery centers around four individuals, Azam, Intan, Mas and Omar, who each respectively are haunted by dreams of ancient folktales or legends. All four of them had once committed a heinous act when they lived at the village together as children.',78,12000.00,9,NULL,0,'2024-11-05 12:00:51','2024-11-08 13:45:18',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,1,5),(7,'Maryam',1,24805844,0,1064449,0,'0','Remux ke, Web-dl ke, web-rip ke, tak kisah sangat mana-mana',293,5000.00,1,NULL,0,'2024-07-31 08:01:48','2024-07-31 08:01:48',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,2,3),(8,'Dr. Pontianak',2,32575557,450619,255617,0,'0','Dr. Pontianak is about Dr. Vivy, a 26-year-old medical trainee who wakes up one day with injuries and a nail behind her neck. Strangely, she develops a craving for blood instead of fearing it',15,1000.00,2,NULL,0,'2024-08-01 03:25:17','2024-08-02 02:32:45',3,399,'2024-08-02 02:32:37',1,3,'2024-08-02 02:32:45',4,3),(9,'Terbaik Dari Langit',1,4131518,0,318767,0,'0','Terbaik Dari Langit atau title lain Nova (2014)\r\n\r\nWEB-DL prefer 1080p, kalau 720p pon boleh.',62,800.00,1,NULL,0,'2024-08-03 06:36:14','2024-08-03 06:36:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,4,3),(10,'Pendekar Awang: Darah Indera Gajah',1,30253785,0,1211994,0,'0','The story revolves around the British finding out that Tok Gajah intends to go to Terengganu to seek support from the Sultan and Malay heroes of Terengganu. The British ordered the capture and elimination of Tok Gajah and his followers. Awang is forced to rescue Haji Sulong and ensure that Tok Gajah safely leaves Pahang for Terengganu. Awang faces various obstacles and battles with British soldiers led by Captain Syers. Does Awang succeed in defeating Captain Syers this time?',142,2200.00,2,NULL,1,'2024-10-26 05:14:37','2024-11-06 00:29:06',3,610,'2024-11-06 00:28:57',1,3,'2024-11-06 00:29:06',4,3),(11,'Janji Diana (2003)',1,347271,0,250102,0,'0','https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0347271/?ref_=tt_mv_desc\r\n1080p or 4k.',555,500.00,1,NULL,0,'2024-10-16 12:54:21','2024-10-16 12:54:21',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,4,3),(12,'Ops Belantara (1992)',1,396780,0,0,0,'0','Any decent quality (dvdrip, vhsrip, web-dl, etc)\r\n\r\nhttps://www.imdb.com/title/tt0396780\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HfbY0VydNk4\r\n\r\nOps Belantara ialah sebuah filem aksi jenayah Malaysia yang ditayangkan pada 1 Mei 1992. Filem ini telah diarahkan oleh Rodzee Razak.',555,500.00,1,NULL,0,'2024-10-16 15:51:56','2024-10-16 15:53:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,3,10),(13,'Mekanik (1983)',1,85925,0,256309,0,'0','Mana-mana kualiti yang baik (hd 1080, 720p, 4K).  Sumber juga tidak penting (BDRIP, HDTV, WEB-DL).\r\n\r\nhttps://www.imdb.com/title/tt0085925/',555,200.00,2,NULL,0,'2024-11-12 11:21:13','2024-11-27 21:37:32',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,4,3),(14,'Bintang Malam (1991)',1,268997,0,672459,0,'0','Kualiti apa pun yang baik (dvdrip, vhsrip, web-dl, hd). Sumber juga tidak penting (BDRIP, HDTV, WEB-DL).\r\n\r\nhttps://