 15 April and 22 April respectively. It is shown every Friday, at 5:30 p.m. on TV3. Fourth, fifth and sixth episodes shown on 27 July, 29 July, and 5 August respectively. Seventh to ninth episodes are shown on 28 October 2016 for three consecutive weeks. Tenth to twelfth episodes are shown on 30 December 2016, 6 January and 13 January 2017. Thirteenth episode (last episode of Season 1) has been shown on 3 March.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eUfXIIufyiBwGYGhJOCekCuae1f.jpg','2016-04-08',NULL,NULL),(84080,69753,3,'Season 3','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fTrsn0qdWWMchIvZlekhPMpydrD.jpg','2016-10-16',NULL,NULL),(84900,70179,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cNKJhBMco4DTjZPwvsK73QTnjYq.jpg','2016-12-16',NULL,NULL),(90990,73107,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4x3qLPbpI7TYWLvMnWHmw0NtAdO.jpg','2018-03-25',NULL,NULL),(92855,73952,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Q1R1EQsxK09euJOD23xNV9AklI.jpg','2013-12-09',NULL,NULL),(96387,70179,2,'Season 2','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9dbj4ipKFbt1qqdHvumiRabXTcX.jpg','2017-11-03',NULL,NULL),(108112,81773,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j7agN5cVhRj06dZiQRahcNmdSdN.jpg','2018-08-16',NULL,NULL),(110165,69753,5,'Season 5','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/inphSLMKepyHKW2UyYy1SVtGvMl.jpg','2018-09-30',NULL,NULL),(113973,84738,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rkT60i3VmRNrvSzQkjPEIMuL7Hg.jpg','2018-11-26',NULL,NULL),(118104,70179,3,'Season 3','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xng7RTnYg5w3GlFxLjxrKJ5ai44.jpg','2019-01-25',NULL,NULL),(119315,73107,2,'Season 2','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eH8YB1FrH7h9PYPJT9z5n1xNCda.jpg','2019-03-31',NULL,NULL),(129511,92201,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iP0dPqQuSHMU5lhMWv439uDyfq8.jpg','2019-02-02',NULL,NULL),(130392,92610,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xne49ZCPenhYL6X0TZze87psxxx.jpg','2018-05-14',NULL,NULL),(130393,92610,2,'Season 2','Ujian demi ujian telah datang kepada Adam dan Nur dalam menempuhi hidup mereka sebagai suami isteri. Setelah berkahwin Adam dan Nur mengajar kanak-kanak mengaji di rumah lama milik Nur. Pada mulanya niat baik mereka itu tidak menghadapi masalah sehinggalah ada penduduk tidak berpuas hati. Jiran mereka terganggu dengan kelas mengaji yang semakin mendapat sambutan, Adam dan Nur perlu mencari tempat baharu tetapi mereka kekurangan dana.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nkNvwzqglZjzcqAQ7Gn6yMHEqqT.jpg','2019-04-02',NULL,NULL),(134881,1790,21,'Season 21','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(135348,69753,6,'Season 6','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ix0AYTR2JE5fl6EoKdzVMnNdR2.jpg','2019-10-13',NULL,NULL),(137901,96374,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/waWHZg5RiH6raqq6BIGng56S72y.jpg','2019-12-11',NULL,NULL),(138897,69676,2,'Season 2','The first episode of Season 2 was broadcast 22 September 2017, with episode two, three and four shown on 29 September. 6 October and 13 October respectively. Just like Season 1, It is shown every Friday, at 5:30 p.m. on TV3, Fifth, sixth, seventh, eighth episodes shown on 17 November, 24 November, 1 December and 8 December respectively. Episode nine to eleven aired from 9 February to 23 February 2018. The twelfth episode was released on 23 March 2018. The thirteenth episode (last episode of Season 2) was released on 30 March, making 26 episodes total.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sd7Sk3gqcjZ7qP1nhwNU9cqHOXP.jpg','2019-04-15',NULL,NULL),(139590,97108,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kfhbYAOCZH2MkrFZDGFCFgYDNgm.jpg','2019-12-17',NULL,NULL),(141128,70179,4,'Season 4','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9dbj4ipKFbt1qqdHvumiRabXTcX.jpg','2020-01-17',NULL,NULL),(153799,84738,2,'Season 2','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b7YbLjFk9eklvhVT6bQnlEWbb7p.jpg','2020-06-15',NULL,NULL),(162433,73952,0,'Specials','',NULL,'2014-04-28',NULL,NULL),(163252,96374,2,'Season 2','','htt