15384,70179,6,'Season 6','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h7JVaFfgAa8ZOElGMBcJBZDXome.jpg','2021-05-27',NULL,NULL),(220626,69753,8,'Season 8','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ArtqutpSotBdTf21PKB35FIY7BO.jpg','2021-11-21',NULL,NULL),(221146,139610,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2021-10-29',NULL,NULL),(236586,153832,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ut0CsNgkYkp2Y6XEUivys1N4YMM.jpg','2021-12-04',NULL,NULL),(238234,154695,1,'Season 1','The first season of consists of 13 episodes and one special extended finale episode. It started airing on Sunday, 13 March 2011 at 7:00 pm on TV3. It was shown on Disney Channel Asia starting 11 June 2011, and on NTV7 starting 24 May 2014.\n\nThe episode starts with the main character, BoBoiBoy on a trip to his grandfather Tok Aba\'s home in Pulau Rintis for the school holidays. At the same time, Adu Du, an alien from the planet of Ata Ta Tiga heads to Earth, to search for energy resources. He finds out that there is cocoa, a powerful energy source, which had extinct from his planet about 30,000 years ago. Adu Du wanted to conquer all the cocoa for himself so that he could be a hero for his planet. To make sure his plan succeeded, he sought help from the Power Sphere (Ochobot). However, a series of mishaps occur and BoBoiBoy obtains Ochobot instead. Ochobot then gives some superpowers to BoBoiBoy and his new friends, Ying, Yaya and Gopal.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ksAOmVScxzImm4amytv6pfFYd08.jpg','2011-03-13',NULL,NULL),(240698,1790,12,'Season 12','',NULL,'2010-09-12',NULL,NULL),(240699,1790,13,'Season 13','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(240700,1790,14,'Season 14','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(240701,1790,15,'Season 15','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(240702,1790,16,'Season 16','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(240703,1790,17,'Season 17','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(240704,1790,18,'Season 18','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(240708,1790,23,'Season 23','',NULL,'2021-09-27',NULL,NULL),(243800,70179,7,'Season 7','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9dbj4ipKFbt1qqdHvumiRabXTcX.jpg','2021-09-23',NULL,NULL),(244092,73107,3,'Season 3','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j1XpwD11f0BAEI7pX6UdMhUVX2F.jpg','2022-04-24',NULL,NULL),(244351,154695,2,'Season 2','The second season consists of 13 episodes, it was aired on Sunday, 27 May 2012 at 7:00 pm on TV3.\n\nIn this season, BoBoiBoy begins a new chapter of his life as he moves to Pulau Rintis to reunite with Tok Aba Bin Abah Kau, Gopal, Ying and Yaya. The story in this season mainly centres on BoBoiBoy and his friends\' life at Pulau Rintis Primary School. BoBoiBoy also encounters a new challenger, Fang at his new school.\n\nFang or Mystery Boy was first introduced in Season 1 on Extended Finale episode. In Season 2 finale BoBoiBoy\'s friends along with Fang fight a super-powerful alien named Ejo Jo who takes all the power watches except for Fang and Boboiboy, and to defeat him, Fang uses his full power.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uwRRCbtrNQfoULzstFwp3u2tbie.jpg','2012-05-27',NULL,NULL),(244352,154695,3,'Season 3','The third season consists of 26 episodes, originally airing from August 2013 to June 2016.\n\nIn this season, BoBoiBoy defeats Ejo Jo, and Adu Du bin Abu Seman becomes BoBoiBoy\'s friend but he turns evil back again because of his mother. Boboiboy also gets his new Fire and Water Elemental powers.\n\nThis is the first season that new episodes would be uploaded onto YouTube before its first airing on TV. It is also the first season to change the theme song, switching out \"BoBoiBoy Superhero Kita\" (English: BoBoiBoy, Our Superhero!) with \"Jagalah Bumi\" by Kotak.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dOVBrjhAQJVTb8duMjaFuTN0gfU.jpg','2013-08-11',NULL,NULL),(244560,70179,8,'Season 8','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9dbj4ipKFbt1qqdHvumiRabXTcX.jpg','2023-07-14',NULL,NULL),(284632,195856,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2022-03-21',NULL,NULL),(286575,196992,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2021-04-12',NULL,NULL),(291583,200752,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2022-04-18',NULL,NULL),(292130,201060,1,'Season 1','Pakar lokasi jenayah, Juliana Hamid menangani kes pembunuhan serta berusaha untuk menjaga hubungannya dengan seorang inspektor dan kesan daripada rahsia keluarga.',NULL,'2020-01-02',NULL,NULL),(295427,203057,1,'Season 1','Firdaus Iskandar\'s parents want him to marry Melur. However, he was against the marriage because he already had a girlfriend named Dee. His parents then give him 48 hours to get Dee to marry him. However, Dee is not yet ready to commit. Melur actually has feelings for Firdaus and is sad to know that Firdaus doesn\'t feel the same. But he did his best to charm her heart and even put 7 conditions that Firdaus had to obey so that Melur would not interfere with his relationship with Dee.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rVxQxsY3bQWTabHUi2Qr3aoOafk.jpg','2022-05-27',NULL,NULL),(296853,203737,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wXNebTabVlyeRh77uozHWBqbMao.jpg','2023-04-12',NULL,NULL),(298831,69676,3,'Season 3','Due to the insistent demand after three years since the end of the second season, it was announced that a third season has been confirmed with undergoing productions of the new episodes, as well as the release of a new teaser music of opening theme. A small teaser trailer was released on 14 October 2021, and a poster released on 28 November 2021, while its official trailer was released on 10 June 2022. It was voted to be most popular local animated series on ABPBH 34.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mm4eEccoYPlMtze3egPwldn8rpx.jpg','2022-06-25',NULL,NULL),(307777,209745,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2022-08-18',NULL,NULL),(309215,69753,9,'Season 9','',NULL,'2022-09-18',NULL,NULL),(309838,210848,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2022-08-19',NULL,NULL),(311784,211891,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vQDytyVGTFPGpAPAi7DR2z0vaqB.jpg','2022-09-23',NULL,NULL),(311785,211892,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gZ6UYAmxUEiT0aEE62f7wC4DvVo.jpg','2022-10-08',NULL,NULL),(319216,96374,3,'Season 3','',NULL,'2022-11-18',NULL,NULL),(320605,8019,13,'Season 13','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k0HiHu2YGsOUehL2j9SayibX8nl.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL),(320606,8019,14,'Season 14','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/saXeFjpNjCND6bu58b6gh7ltdZI.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL),(320607,8019,15,'Season 15','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9AKH8gbxS7nUc5iaN39aYXFXXHf.jpg','2021-04-13',NULL,NULL),(320608,8019,16,'Season 16','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gIQ2bs8iNqfgcAI42O933tdwTDd.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL),(322515,153832,2,'Season 2','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9q13fSWin2TexoiHcRxSMfSJAn1.jpg','2022-12-05',NULL,NULL),(324823,218507,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/elFYWhoIByyJi9jazlII2kVfdB6.jpg','2023-01-23',NULL,NULL),(326137,1790,24,'Season 24','',NULL,'2022-09-26',NULL,NULL),(328184,220080,1,'Season 1','When eight strangers wake up in a mansion guarded by an elderly woman with a hunched back (Nenek), they soon realise that they are being held hostage, not only in the mansion and its surrounding forest, but in an entirely unfamiliar dimension altogether. With a sinister threat looming, the eight are left with no choice but to complete a series of \'games\' created by Nenek in the hope they can one day return to the lives they once knew.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fqZ45IpkKjsEs7Qo6P9JoJGwHeG.jpg','2023-02-09',NULL,NULL),(331625,73107,4,'Season 4','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oRlIr9yC2cFDzvoIsnQpJrQANmy.jpg','2023-04-16',NULL,NULL),(331723,221888,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2023-03-03',NULL,NULL),(332670,203057,2,'Season 2','Continuation of the story of Melur and Firdaus brought together by their family. Their household was tested once again with the appearance of Mawar. Mawar who?','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbn12lgWnSE9WuZGOwmGIfFMy6z.jpg','2023-03-16',NULL,NULL),(334977,223538,1,'Musim 1','Sebuah rancangan kembara realiti komedi, mereka perlu meluangkan masa bersama & mengharungi segala cabaran yang telah ditetapkan.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rZw6VL5Fe9p0YMbLMdZpCt8lBj9.jpg','2023-03-23',NULL,NULL),(342282,203737,0,'Specials','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2eXvTakSVgd43MT9SCQwvTMp5Tv.jpg','2023-05-31',NULL,NULL),(342967,227437,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2023-05-25',NULL,NULL),(349738,231152,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2019-11-28',NULL,NULL),(349783,70179,9,'Season 9','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ksFsvJTm1ozDuM4FOKomYQc2HR.jpg','2024-05-03',NULL,NULL),(358210,235661,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2023-09-21',NULL,NULL),(358489,235791,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2023-09-25',NULL,NULL),(359721,69753,10,'All Stars Gegar Vaganza (S10)','Dengan menampilkan juara-juara sepanjang sembilan musim serta lima pilihan para peminat, â€˜GVâ€™ kali ini semestinya lebih sengit kerana para peserta bakal berentap dengan yang terbaik di persada muzik tempatan bahkan nusantara. All Stars Gegar Vaganza mengekalkan format asal penjurian yang diadili berdasarkan sistem pemarkahan 100% oleh barisan juri profesional. Peserta yang mendapat markah terendah pada setiap minggu akan disingkirkan. Juara akan membawa pulang wang tunai sebanyak RM200, 000.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qjQ7utBLG3tO59f8RYr1lMk76ZD.jpg','2023-09-24',NULL,NULL),(360723,237046,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8TObTM4GfMrNOgpb96jZKG9iI0F.jpg','2021-01-08',NULL,NULL),(360724,237046,2,'Season 2','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u0YXyXPZDAUG1ZRLajw8EJEcuOK.jpg','2022-05-12',NULL,NULL),(364035,1790,2,'Season 2','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364036,1790,4,'Season 4','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364037,1790,5,'Season 5','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364043,1790,6,'Season 6','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364044,1790,7,'Season 7','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364045,1790,8,'Season 8','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364046,1790,9,'Season 9','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364047,1790,10,'Season 10','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364048,1790,11,'Season 11','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364050,1790,25,'Season 25','',NULL,'2023-09-25',NULL,NULL),(364053,1790,20,'Season 20','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(364054,1790,22,'Season 22','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(365998,223538,2,'Musim 2','Geng bapak bapak kembali menemani anda dengan musim terbaru! Saksikan Projek Bapak Bapak S2 yg akan menjelajah Australia. Apakah cabaran dan gelagat lucu bapak bapak kali ini?','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fAb0u0NVlYSzx8x4xZhyMEDrYcw.jpg','2023-11-02',NULL,NULL),(370061,241676,1,'Season 1','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(371727,69620,2,'BoBoiBoy Galaxy Sori','After defeating Retak\'ka, BoBoiBoy needs to train his body and learn to harness his Third Tier Elemental Powers to maintain intergalactic peace.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m55y0qfrDMYAsAviVxpleJWZJlP.jpg','2023-12-03',NULL,NULL),(378270,210848,2,'Season 2','',NULL,'2024-01-10',NULL,NULL),(382141,248117,1,'Musim 1','Apabila pencipta aplikasi telah dipecat secara tidak adil dan tidak lagi dapat bertemu dengan \"jodohnya\", dia telah memutuskan untuk menghadapi ketakutannya yang membawa kepada serangan penipu terbesar negara yang pernah diketahui dalam sejarah.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/514RPHZpihGOt7I02GeWnmxmPQe.jpg','2024-02-23',NULL,NULL),(383808,249102,1,'Musim 1','Mengisahkan tentang Aileen, wanita yang mempercayai bahawa cinta dan kesetiaan kepada suami merupakan kunci ke â€œSyurgaâ€. Dia disatukan dengan Farid, yang digambarkan sebagai suami yang sempurna dari segi agama dan tanggungjawab keduniaan telah mula menampakkan identitinya yang disembunyikan disebalik perwatakan yang baik.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zfHPMEqyqjj0xmuFOuGwoEaUDZp.jpg','2023-12-04',NULL,NULL),(383821,249110,1,'Musim 1','Kelahiran Che Khun sebagai Khunsa memberi impak kepada emosi bapanya. Dia memaksa & membesarkan Che Khun sebagai lelaki dan membuat hidup Che Khun sengsara.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xSKH55ZjoPp5jEo1bshbjzgPJy7.jpg','2024-03-11',NULL,NULL),(389138,223538,3,'Musim 3 : Dubai dan Korea','Projek Bapak Bapak S3 kembali dengan kelainan baru kali ini mereka melancong ke Dubai dan Korea. Adakah mereka akan bertahan dalam pengembaraan dua lokasi dengan jet lag, halangan bahasa dan cabaran yang lebih gila?','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/edtU5HlU6JWcRUyizj8T1TxpI4K.jpg','2024-04-18',NULL,NULL),(389191,223538,0,'Specials','Episod-episod spesel di bawah siri Projek Bapak Bapak','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/MZzVLbZPPJ6MAbRrbQZq6vM3vh.jpg','2024-04-10',NULL,NULL),(389944,211891,2,'Season 2','',NULL,'2024-01-19',NULL,NULL),(391672,69620,3,'BoBoiBoy Galaxy Windara','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3zbe3GMIsWfsJUXrj5Et5uxn69b.jpg','2024-06-01',NULL,NULL),(392616,69620,4,'Boboiboy Galaxy Dwifusion','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(396093,255617,1,'Musim 1','Dr.Vivy terkejut apabila mendapati dirinya terjaga di dalam longkang. Keadaan ini lebih pelik apabila Dr.Vivy dapat melihat Edna, hantu hospital. Kewujudan paku di leher Dr.Vivy menimbulkan rasa ingin tahu.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/94SE5BGEpnVVg1RSBEupSi3p9Wz.jpg','2024-05-03',NULL,NULL),(401401,258733,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cILppbhohWzq5y31BmScHQAD7fB.jpg','2024-06-27',NULL,NULL),(404210,260197,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2024-07-25',NULL,NULL),(418836,271651,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2024-06-13',NULL,NULL),(419626,272103,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2023-11-30',NULL,NULL),(420706,272726,1,'Kelate VS Ganu','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lkZfjCotjFuxUaidgOTKDhIqmbA.jpg','2024-07-19',NULL,NULL),(420710,272729,1,'Musim 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hfyUYCtTYXl7vZuMnIO5pQPswfY.jpg','2024-09-25',NULL,NULL),(425188,275182,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2024-06-12',NULL,NULL),(425200,275192,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2024-05-03',NULL,NULL),(425371,275288,1,'Season 1','',NULL,'2021-06-13',NULL,NULL),(425973,275589,1,'Season 1','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jPzAErCxGSLjakC9xW1GLo1LzFT.jpg','2024-10-01',NULL,NULL),(430169,69753,11,'Season 11','','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y