g','0',0,'2024-09-17 13:49:44','2024-09-17 13:50:48',NULL),(92610,NULL,'','',NULL,'Nur','Nur','Mengisahkan Adam, anak kepada seorang penceramah selebriti terkenal iaitu Datuk Ayah Haji Mukhsin. Adam merupakan satu-satunya anak lelaki kepada Datuk Ayah dan amat terkenal di media sosial dengan kekacakannya. Setelah Adam kembali dari menyambung pelajarannya di timur tengah dalam jurusan Usuluddin, Adam bakal menggantikan tempat ayahnya dalam bidang dakwah. Demi merealisasikan cita-citanya itu, Adam mendapat bantuan kakaknya, Siti Aishah yang menjadi pengurusnya.',34,NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'2018-05-14','Returning Series','',1,'2019-04-25',NULL,'MY','ms','Nur','11.514','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cp8EjA9pjQ2daQzBfK8UWFA6uQH.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qIufERxMEKRHTfeBqH8FpoTLEIQ.jpg','8.5',2,'2024-06-29 11:21:50','2024-06-29 11:21:50','za_5gHKy3VM'),(96374,NULL,'','',NULL,'Kampung People','Kampung People','Razif works with Mr. Suhaimi who sells illegal goods. While Razif was busy managing the sale, police raided their place and arrested him. Razif was questioned and sentenced to 15 years in prison for not confessing to the case and was forced to testify against his former boss, Mr Suhaimi in court. Razif received threats from the \'Cengkih Manis\' group but Razif and his family were put into the Witness Protection Program by the police so that they would not be killed before the prosecution\'s case. Razif\'s family had to disguise and convert their identity into villagers and had to adapt to the village environment.',40,NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'2019-12-11','Returning Series','',1,'2022-12-09',NULL,'MY','ms','Kampung People','5.076','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9aelcOlEQzSNWk6bDueC3xc0xvT.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/waWHZg5RiH6raqq6BIGng56S72y.jpg','0',0,'2024-06-28 13:50:50','2024-06-28 13:50:50','nt5oVImft7s'),(97108,NULL,'11479072','',NULL,'Black','Black','This Black drama revolves around supernatural beings from another dimension, namely elves. This elf character with the name Black is starring Kamal Adli. Black enters the human realm by using the body of a deceased policeman (Detective Malik) to find his friend.',18,NULL,NULL,2,'56','2019-12-17','Returning Series','',1,'2021-06-19',NULL,'MY','ms','Black','10.11','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eBlOLoleLKMEyTREWrkHQtSxg9t.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/EGIl5hM6XSeva7ERc01bOrhVdd.jpg','8',1,'2024-06-22 14:26:04','2024-06-22 14:26:04',NULL),(114175,NULL,'','',NULL,'Isteri Misteri','Isteri Misteri','Rizal, a Playboy who receives a shaman\'s prediction that one of his wife wants to kill him. With the help of his assistant, Jun, he has to save himself as well as thwart his wife\'s plans. However, the main problem is that he has three wives!',10,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'2020-11-25','Returning Series','',1,'2020-12-24',NULL,'MY','ms','Isteri Misteri','1.864','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7aGEXrDAeQZks5mWFrmiif27QQP.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f8hfQXTXJ3vL9BkOFC6WCpA0fWd.jpg','0',0,'2024-06-28 10:04:06','2024-06-28 10:04:06',NULL),(120814,NULL,'0309196','316903',NULL,'Phua Chu Kang Pte Ltd','Phua Chu Kang Pte Ltd','',159,NULL,NULL,8,NULL,'1997-09-25','Returning Series','',1,'2007-02-11',NULL,'SG','en','Phua Chu Kang Pte Ltd','216.721',NULL,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vw1BCMu0N6lkxKtzYn60H09KLjY.jpg','0',0,'2024-07-16 02:07:09','2024-07-16 02:07:09',NULL),(124098,NULL,'3201906','',NULL,'Pi Mai Pi Mai Tang Tu','Pi Mai Pi Mai Tang Tu','',15,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,'Ended','',0,NULL,NULL,'MY','ms','Pi Mai Pi Mai Tang Tu','9.57','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zlPS2jK0fINMiKSUVoUbqMD2rqK.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nTU8RyqQ7xV2zhhSqaophOQ3JgT.jpg','0',0,'2024-07-01 09:32:44','2024-07-01 09:32:44',NULL),(139610,NULL,'','',NULL,'Best Of Senario Series','Best Of Senario Series','',52,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'2021-10-29','Returning Series','',1,'2021-11-05',NULL,'MY','ms','Best Of Senario Series','10.489',NULL,'http