nKematian pelajar itu menjadi misteri apabila semua rakan-rakannya mendiamkan diri tentang apa yang berlaku.',20,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'2024-09-25 00:00:00','Returning Series','',1,'2024-10-31 00:00:00',NULL,'MY','ms','Kelas Tahanan Cikgu Hiragi','46.208','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uepRhWAAPTOxtO9GZ4x72YWPyfN.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hfyUYCtTYXl7vZuMnIO5pQPswfY.jpg','0',0,'2024-10-09 00:56:59','2024-11-29 01:39:19',NULL),(275182,NULL,'','',NULL,'Dua Darjat','Dua Darjat','',13,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'2024-06-12 00:00:00','Returning Series','',1,'2024-06-28 00:00:00',NULL,'MY','ms','Dua Darjat','0.181','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jmA68JRSspnfS9uc2A5ftsifX8y.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pjKFcKMwK2nJQeLeerBCl71yq8F.jpg','0',0,'2024-11-05 00:02:37','2024-11-05 00:02:37',NULL),(275192,NULL,'','',NULL,'Aku Bukan Ustazah','Aku Bukan Ustazah','',28,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'2024-05-03 00:00:00','Ended','',0,'2024-06-11 00:00:00',NULL,'MY','ms','Aku Bukan Ustazah','0.171','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e364od5LjVLrgKK7EAHAD2OaLuI.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3rJRqe7Li1NVPnSmcY4TeTHOXmA.jpg','0',0,'2024-11-06 11:57:46','2024-11-06 11:57:46',NULL),(275288,NULL,'','',NULL,'Keluarga Instafamous','Keluarga Instafamous','Mengisahkan hidup keluarga Zaid yang meraihkan berjuta-juta tontonan dengan video mereka yang tular di media sosial.',1,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'2021-06-13 00:00:00','Returning Series','',1,'2021-06-13 00:00:00',NULL,'MY','en','Keluarga Instafamous','0.36',NULL,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rBBs2HmV2OU1iiKDQs4W9nnPj3A.jpg','0',0,'2024-10-26 11:38:03','2024-10-28 23:26:23',NULL),(275589,NULL,'','456103',NULL,'Andai Tiada Dia','Andai Tiada Dia','',36,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'2024-10-01 00:00:00','Returning Series','https://www.myinfotaip.com/2024/10/andai-tiada-dia.html',1,'2024-11-14 00:00:00',NULL,'MY','ms','Andai Tiada Dia','73.334','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jPRUlO5civ37c5LPKsiJNO44Icf.jpg','https://image.tmdb.o